(5421081, 778116, 44611, '<td valign="top">Such a shame that you left the power lines in .. they rather distract, particularly from the ''historic'' element.  It was advanced editing so it would have been ok to clone those out.  Otherwise a lovely card, good composition and nice leading line through it with the lane.</td>', 'Such a shame that you left the power lines in .. they rather distract, particularly from the ''historic'' element.  It was advanced editing so it would have been ok to clone those out.  Otherwise a lovely card, good composition and nice leading line through it with the lane.', '2009-04-06 06:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421082, 779773, 44611, '<td valign="top">Brilliant!  This made me smile.</td>', 'Brilliant!  This made me smile.', '2009-04-06 06:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421085, 779200, 99263, '<td valign="top">Pragtige foto wat die boodskap "Infinite Possibilities" kragtig uitdra. Een van my favoriete.</td>', 'Pragtige foto wat die boodskap "Infinite Possibilities" kragtig uitdra. Een van my favoriete.', '2009-04-06 06:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421095, 779581, 77815, '<td valign="top">I guess this is Vikram, Simply Superb !!</td>', 'I guess this is Vikram, Simply Superb !!', '2009-04-06 06:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421099, 779774, 24073, '<td valign="top">A fantastic photo that will probably not get as good of score as it should because of DNMC''s.  Don''t be discouraged though its a great, great shot.</td>', 'A fantastic photo that will probably not get as good of score as it should because of DNMC''s.  Don''t be discouraged though its a great, great shot.', '2009-04-06 07:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421109, 779736, 24073, '<td valign="top">Excellent, excellent.  Very nice good, clean photo.  As for postcard...</td>', 'Excellent, excellent.  Very nice good, clean photo.  As for postcard...', '2009-04-06 07:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421123, 779732, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very nice generic stock shot with a couple of issues. The tower halo on the left hand side attracted me immediately which is not what you intended. From a framing standpoint, think it would have worked better with the empty sky on the right cropped out - a little tighter composition, a little less exposure and just a tad more focus would have made this a great image. I like the font. Overall a good effort.</td>', 'A very nice generic stock shot with a couple of issues. The tower halo on the left hand side attracted me immediately which is not what you intended. From a framing standpoint, think it would have worked better with the empty sky on the right cropped out - a little tighter composition, a little less exposure and just a tad more focus would have made this a great image. I like the font. Overall a good effort.', '2009-04-06 07:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421124, 779640, 101256, '<td valign="top">The image looks a little washed out - maybe a little tighter shot on the hiker in the background would have helped a little. The darker scene and colors made for a difficult shot and the lighting conditions didn''t help you any.  I like the way you handled the font colors - not a great composition, but it does invoke the nature of Iceland.</td>', 'The image looks a little washed out - maybe a little tighter shot on the hiker in the background would have helped a little. The darker scene and colors made for a difficult shot and the lighting conditions didn''t help you any.  I like the way you handled the font colors - not a great composition, but it does invoke the nature of Iceland.', '2009-04-06 08:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421130, 779749, 101256, '<td valign="top">I smiled when I saw this - I think I''ve been there - Texas? Very evocative of small towns everywhere.  From a technical standpoint, it''s not a particularly stellar example of what a camera and lens can do - it''s not really in focus, but then again, the point is Possum Trot. From a strictly appeal standpoint, it works very well. And it''s funny.  I like it - nice job.</td>', 'I smiled when I saw this - I think I''ve been there - Texas? Very evocative of small towns everywhere.  From a technical standpoint, it''s not a particularly stellar example of what a camera and lens can do - it''s not really in focus, but then again, the point is Possum Trot. From a strictly appeal standpoint, it works very well. And it''s funny.  I like it - nice job.', '2009-04-06 08:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421137, 779755, 101256, '<td valign="top">A difficult shot and way too much light blue to be truly effective. The white haze blending into the blue sky creates a border within the image that is distracting. You might have done better to crop the bottom off thus making a little tighter shot and a little more impact. The image also isn''t level - it tilts up to the right (or down to the left) which creates an uncomfortable feeling on first viewing. A contrasting font color would have worked much better.</td>', 'A difficult shot and way too much light blue to be truly effective. The white haze blending into the blue sky creates a border within the image that is distracting. You might have done better to crop the bottom off thus making a little tighter shot and a little more impact. The image also isn''t level - it tilts up to the right (or down to the left) which creates an uncomfortable feeling on first viewing. A contrasting font color would have worked much better.', '2009-04-06 08:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421140, 779524, 101256, '<td valign="top">A nice scene, but the image is a little soft on focus which negatively impacts the scene. A Neutral Density filter - a .6 would have helped the sky details and popped the colors of the village out reducing some of the blandness (if that''s a word). I''m not crazy about the font either - the problem with the more artistic fonts is that the kerning is never perfect and you acquire issues like the n m and u all running together.  Nice image though - very peaceful.</td>', 'A nice scene, but the image is a little soft on focus which negatively impacts the scene. A Neutral Density filter - a .6 would have helped the sky details and popped the colors of the village out reducing some of the blandness (if that''s a word). I''m not crazy about the font either - the problem with the more artistic fonts is that the kerning is never perfect and you acquire issues like the n m and u all running together.  Nice image though - very peaceful.', '2009-04-06 08:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421145, 779350, 101256, '<td valign="top">The image is tilted to the left and the logo doesn''t help that any. From a technical standpoint, the image is properly focused, but it''s a tad oversharpened - you can see the halo on the right side of the clock tower. However, it is iconic of UC-Berkely and that''s what counts.</td>', 'The image is tilted to the left and the logo doesn''t help that any. From a technical standpoint, the image is properly focused, but it''s a tad oversharpened - you can see the halo on the right side of the clock tower. However, it is iconic of UC-Berkely and that''s what counts.', '2009-04-06 08:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421149, 779512, 86359, '<td valign="top">Excellent entry for "Textures" Challenge...</td>', 'Excellent entry for "Textures" Challenge...', '2009-04-06 08:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421154, 779745, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is going to sound really picky and trite, but this could be any center city shot in the North East in Winter. The eye is drawn to the sky scrapers which you can see anywhere. I might have picked something a little more iconic of Philly - like Geno''s. :&gt;) Froma technical standpoint, it''s a good image, but fairly generic. The font is fine, but also generic.</td>', 'This is going to sound really picky and trite, but this could be any center city shot in the North East in Winter. The eye is drawn to the sky scrapers which you can see anywhere. I might have picked something a little more iconic of Philly - like Geno''s. :>) Froma technical standpoint, it''s a good image, but fairly generic. The font is fine, but also generic.', '2009-04-06 08:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421155, 778696, 92577, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2009-04-06 08:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421159, 779715, 92577, '<td valign="top">I''m a big fan of low light / night shots, but I fear this may look almost black on some monitors</td>', 'I''m a big fan of low light / night shots, but I fear this may look almost black on some monitors', '2009-04-06 08:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421165, 779052, 92577, '<td valign="top">fascinating - (it was never like that when I was there!)</td>', 'fascinating - (it was never like that when I was there!)', '2009-04-06 08:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421166, 779244, 92577, '<td valign="top">nicely done</td>', 'nicely done', '2009-04-06 08:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421167, 779137, 101678, '<td valign="top">What a terrific image... very creative crop.  I really wish the Text didn''t dissect the hill like that, but without that, it''s wonderful.</td>', 'What a terrific image... very creative crop.  I really wish the Text didn''t dissect the hill like that, but without that, it''s wonderful.', '2009-04-06 08:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421170, 778684, 92577, '<td valign="top">this is neat</td>', 'this is neat', '2009-04-06 08:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421171, 778060, 92577, '<td valign="top">cool lettering</td>', 'cool lettering', '2009-04-06 08:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421176, 779175, 92577, '<td valign="top">clever stuff</td>', 'clever stuff', '2009-04-06 09:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421191, 779469, 101256, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea. Very colorful, excellant skin tones, but (you knew there had to be) the execution is a little flawed. You might have done better bouncing the flash or using some back lighting because you have what appears to be a halo around the black shirt which can be indicative of over sharpening, but in this case it''s a reflection off the wall. Same with the shadows on the hat.  I like the way you tried to match the font with the hat - that was a good idea, but it didn''t quite work out - I would have cloned out the little red dots. Nice capture - invokes a sense of fun. Nicely done.</td>', 'I really like the idea. Very colorful, excellant skin tones, but (you knew there had to be) the execution is a little flawed. You might have done better bouncing the flash or using some back lighting because you have what appears to be a halo around the black shirt which can be indicative of over sharpening, but in this case it''s a reflection off the wall. Same with the shadows on the hat.  I like the way you tried to match the font with the hat - that was a good idea, but it didn''t quite work out - I would have cloned out the little red dots. Nice capture - invokes a sense of fun. Nicely done.', '2009-04-06 09:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421196, 779497, 92577, '<td valign="top">The picture and the lettering at the top are both very stylish.<br/>The lettering at the bottom and the thick black borders, I''m not so keen on. Good luck.</td>', 'The picture and the lettering at the top are both very stylish.The lettering at the bottom and the thick black borders, I''m not so keen on. Good luck.', '2009-04-06 09:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421201, 779200, 52549, '<td valign="top">Truly beautiful and my favourite so far. Hope for top 3 for you.</td>', 'Truly beautiful and my favourite so far. Hope for top 3 for you.', '2009-04-06 09:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421203, 779069, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''ll be the first to admit - I''m a font Nazi. :&gt;) In this case, a good attempt was distorted by the mixed fonts.  Pick one or the other or at least try to match them up a little better - the antique block doesn''t fit well with the script.  The script color works well (even though I''m not a fan of script in general), but the red doesn''t match the overall color theme. I''ve been to Siesta Key and you''re right - the fishing is fine. A nice effort, but flawed.</td>', 'I''ll be the first to admit - I''m a font Nazi. :>) In this case, a good attempt was distorted by the mixed fonts.  Pick one or the other or at least try to match them up a little better - the antique block doesn''t fit well with the script.  The script color works well (even though I''m not a fan of script in general), but the red doesn''t match the overall color theme. I''ve been to Siesta Key and you''re right - the fishing is fine. A nice effort, but flawed.', '2009-04-06 09:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421212, 779598, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very nice image with great color tone - a little bit over sharpened. The font and color compliment the image in a subtle way. Very pleasing image to the eye with a few minor issues. Very nice.</td>', 'A very nice image with great color tone - a little bit over sharpened. The font and color compliment the image in a subtle way. Very pleasing image to the eye with a few minor issues. Very nice.', '2009-04-06 09:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421215, 779576, 92577, '<td valign="top">very nice - you can do it all again in this week''s challenge!</td>', 'very nice - you can do it all again in this week''s challenge!', '2009-04-06 09:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421216, 779742, 101256, '<td valign="top">An iconic image of our nation and the City of New York. Not marred by font, the central theme of liberty stands out on it''s own. Nothing technically wrong with the image, although I would have liked to see the background flag a little more as both are symbols of our nation and the city. Well done.</td>', 'An iconic image of our nation and the City of New York. Not marred by font, the central theme of liberty stands out on it''s own. Nothing technically wrong with the image, although I would have liked to see the background flag a little more as both are symbols of our nation and the city. Well done.', '2009-04-06 09:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421217, 779656, 92577, '<td valign="top">neat bw evocative of a bygone era</td>', 'neat bw evocative of a bygone era', '2009-04-06 09:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421220, 779627, 92577, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2009-04-06 09:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421222, 779802, 92577, '<td valign="top">nice retro look</td>', 'nice retro look', '2009-04-06 09:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421224, 779633, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another great image - the sky matching the water is a very nice touch and as a marketing image, it would work well as a post card - it''s sharp and evokes a sense of peace and quiet.  Not fond of the way the font and color were treated - I might have worked with a slightly different font other than block black.</td>', 'Another great image - the sky matching the water is a very nice touch and as a marketing image, it would work well as a post card - it''s sharp and evokes a sense of peace and quiet.  Not fond of the way the font and color were treated - I might have worked with a slightly different font other than block black.', '2009-04-06 09:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421228, 779807, 92577, '<td valign="top">nice handling of exposure. viewpoint isn''t the most inspiring</td>', 'nice handling of exposure. viewpoint isn''t the most inspiring', '2009-04-06 09:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421233, 779810, 101256, '<td valign="top">There is an interesting optical illusion here - I get the sense that the image is a trapazoid - it''s not, but that''s the illusion I get. The reason is that the title isn''t level. The Austin, Texas is and that''s why. Interesting effect - I have to remember that. I might have picked a little better subject than the one the author did, but the DOF control with the image is terrific. There are two ways this could have gone - I think you picked the correct concept, but the wrong subject.  However, the font and font color matches the theme and overall tone of the image.</td>', 'There is an interesting optical illusion here - I get the sense that the image is a trapazoid - it''s not, but that''s the illusion I get. The reason is that the title isn''t level. The Austin, Texas is and that''s why. Interesting effect - I have to remember that. I might have picked a little better subject than the one the author did, but the DOF control with the image is terrific. There are two ways this could have gone - I think you picked the correct concept, but the wrong subject.  However, the font and font color matches the theme and overall tone of the image.', '2009-04-06 09:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421238, 779798, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the author''s intent here - I think I know, but I''m not getting a real feel for it. As an image, it''s very competant, DOF is well controlled and the subtle color mix is truly effective. I like the font, but there are problems with the drop/3D effects as parts of the individual letters disappear - particularly the M and N. This type of font works well with more contrasty backgrounds.  I would mark this higher if I was sure of the author''s intent.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the author''s intent here - I think I know, but I''m not getting a real feel for it. As an image, it''s very competant, DOF is well controlled and the subtle color mix is truly effective. I like the font, but there are problems with the drop/3D effects as parts of the individual letters disappear - particularly the M and N. This type of font works well with more contrasty backgrounds.  I would mark this higher if I was sure of the author''s intent.', '2009-04-06 09:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
