(5421581, 779652, 100064, '<td valign="top">I dont get it. I dont like the picture. The child looks like he wants to throw up. Its just not at all something I would send someone from Iceland with all of its majestic beauty to be in a picture.</td>', 'I dont get it. I dont like the picture. The child looks like he wants to throw up. Its just not at all something I would send someone from Iceland with all of its majestic beauty to be in a picture.', '2009-04-06 11:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
