(5421585, 779102, 100064, '<td valign="top">I love this!!</td>', 'I love this!!', '2009-04-06 11:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421587, 779052, 74911, '<td valign="top">To me, everything is perfect about this shot. I can see the efforts went on setting this up. The dreamy effect, the colors, the IR, the composition, the framing and the text style - everything is super good. This should ribbon IMO.</td>', 'To me, everything is perfect about this shot. I can see the efforts went on setting this up. The dreamy effect, the colors, the IR, the composition, the framing and the text style - everything is super good. This should ribbon IMO.', '2009-04-06 11:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421590, 779244, 74911, '<td valign="top">Great composition and point of view. Nice colors. I would have cloned out that small patch of clouds in front of the lion''s face, which in my opinion is a bit distracting that helping the shot. The water from the fountain is well exposed too.</td>', 'Great composition and point of view. Nice colors. I would have cloned out that small patch of clouds in front of the lion''s face, which in my opinion is a bit distracting that helping the shot. The water from the fountain is well exposed too.', '2009-04-06 11:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421597, 779774, 20577, '<td valign="top">Get some pants on that boy!</td>', 'Get some pants on that boy!', '2009-04-06 11:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421604, 778980, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like the intent and I very much like the font and the way it was handled - very effective and evocative. The DOF works against it as a "post card", but as an image, it''s great. I really like the way the author handled the odd lighting - very effective exposure. It does the job in evoking an interest in the zoo.</td>', 'I like the intent and I very much like the font and the way it was handled - very effective and evocative. The DOF works against it as a "post card", but as an image, it''s great. I really like the way the author handled the odd lighting - very effective exposure. It does the job in evoking an interest in the zoo.', '2009-04-06 12:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421609, 779652, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure this works as well as it could and I''m not at all sure about the author''s intent. As an image, it''s nicely detailed, nicely composed and executed, but the point of a postcard image should be to entice the viewer into good and positive feeling about the location - this doesn''t quite do it. I''m not at all sure about the meaning of the title as opposed to the image either - it seems to me to be a mixed message with the unhappy child.</td>', 'I''m not sure this works as well as it could and I''m not at all sure about the author''s intent. As an image, it''s nicely detailed, nicely composed and executed, but the point of a postcard image should be to entice the viewer into good and positive feeling about the location - this doesn''t quite do it. I''m not at all sure about the meaning of the title as opposed to the image either - it seems to me to be a mixed message with the unhappy child.', '2009-04-06 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421611, 779715, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very clever use of DOF in reverse - it resonates with the impression of romance and history. The font is a little small, but the color is perfect and matches the mood and overall emotional appear - it''s not bathetic at all. The background is detailed and rich with color even given the darker cast of blue. Nicely executed.</td>', 'A very clever use of DOF in reverse - it resonates with the impression of romance and history. The font is a little small, but the color is perfect and matches the mood and overall emotional appear - it''s not bathetic at all. The background is detailed and rich with color even given the darker cast of blue. Nicely executed.', '2009-04-06 12:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421613, 779200, 74911, '<td valign="top">Wow!!! Great mood, excellent colors, brilliant composition. This cannot get any better than this. Good luck.</td>', 'Wow!!! Great mood, excellent colors, brilliant composition. This cannot get any better than this. Good luck.', '2009-04-06 12:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421614, 779641, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid commercial image. The font is appropriate although I would have used a different color. The image seems a little out of focus and the colors are overly saturated - you can''t really tell what the red sign says unless you really squint and look closely. It does as intended and that''s a plus.</td>', 'A good solid commercial image. The font is appropriate although I would have used a different color. The image seems a little out of focus and the colors are overly saturated - you can''t really tell what the red sign says unless you really squint and look closely. It does as intended and that''s a plus.', '2009-04-06 12:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421615, 779805, 5376, '<td valign="top">this is nice!</td>', 'this is nice!', '2009-04-06 12:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
