(5421625, 779109, 101256, '<td valign="top">A tough one to rate because the composition is perfect, the subject matter is perfect, the font selection and placement is perfect, but the image lacks somewhat in execution. If the color on the blossoms on the right had been carried over to the left, it would have worked perfectly and made the slightly washed out background stand out. As it is though, it''s a good depiction of the general impression if you will of Washington. Very nice - good job.</td>', 'A tough one to rate because the composition is perfect, the subject matter is perfect, the font selection and placement is perfect, but the image lacks somewhat in execution. If the color on the blossoms on the right had been carried over to the left, it would have worked perfectly and made the slightly washed out background stand out. As it is though, it''s a good depiction of the general impression if you will of Washington. Very nice - good job.', '2009-04-06 12:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
