(5421632, 779700, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like the author''s intent here, but the focus is softer than it should be. If it were sharper, it would have been a great image. The font selection is good, but the underline is not necessary and the color choice was less than thoughtful. It does what it''s meant to do though which is represent the Met and it''s majesty - it just has those few flaws that mar the overall impact.</td>', 'I like the author''s intent here, but the focus is softer than it should be. If it were sharper, it would have been a great image. The font selection is good, but the underline is not necessary and the color choice was less than thoughtful. It does what it''s meant to do though which is represent the Met and it''s majesty - it just has those few flaws that mar the overall impact.', '2009-04-06 12:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
