(5421721, 779463, 101256, '<td valign="top">It''s not as tacky as the author believes - the image is reasonably sharp, the Opera House a symbol of Sydney, the sky is kind of blah, but it does add a dramatic component to the image. The font is acceptable, but I can''t think of a reason why the elipses in the front of Sydney.</td>', 'It''s not as tacky as the author believes - the image is reasonably sharp, the Opera House a symbol of Sydney, the sky is kind of blah, but it does add a dramatic component to the image. The font is acceptable, but I can''t think of a reason why the elipses in the front of Sydney.', '2009-04-06 12:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421722, 779759, 59029, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  Glad to know it''s Phoenix but I''d take the font down about 14 pts. 7</td>', 'Whoa!  Glad to know it''s Phoenix but I''d take the font down about 14 pts. 7', '2009-04-06 12:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
