(5421750, 779175, 101256, '<td valign="top">As an image, this is outstanding HDR work - it has a 3D quality that is very hard to achieve. The color balance is excellant and the details unrivaled - it is a terrific composition and was processed with incredible skill. Unfortunately, I can''t figure out what the connection is to Memphis. I would love to rate this a ten as an image, but I can''t.</td>', 'As an image, this is outstanding HDR work - it has a 3D quality that is very hard to achieve. The color balance is excellant and the details unrivaled - it is a terrific composition and was processed with incredible skill. Unfortunately, I can''t figure out what the connection is to Memphis. I would love to rate this a ten as an image, but I can''t.', '2009-04-06 13:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421751, 779810, 59029, '<td valign="top">like the shot but wish the lettering were higher up. Looks like it''s crushing the leaves!</td>', 'like the shot but wish the lettering were higher up. Looks like it''s crushing the leaves!', '2009-04-06 13:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421755, 779614, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is another terrific image rich in detail - it gives a great impression, but as a post card, I don''t get the connection.</td>', 'This is another terrific image rich in detail - it gives a great impression, but as a post card, I don''t get the connection.', '2009-04-06 13:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421756, 779533, 59029, '<td valign="top">cool, I was born kinda in that area.  neat to see what it looks like, all twisted and warped! 7</td>', 'cool, I was born kinda in that area.  neat to see what it looks like, all twisted and warped! 7', '2009-04-06 13:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421765, 779594, 101256, '<td valign="top">The motion in the boats creates a very interesting effect, but it doesn''t compliment the image. If this has been sharpened, it is right on the edge of being over done. Good font selection and color - if the image had been sharper with less motion on the boats, it would have been a very good representatin of the city.</td>', 'The motion in the boats creates a very interesting effect, but it doesn''t compliment the image. If this has been sharpened, it is right on the edge of being over done. Good font selection and color - if the image had been sharper with less motion on the boats, it would have been a very good representatin of the city.', '2009-04-06 13:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421768, 779611, 96823, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, the bridge IMO is a little distracting. I don''t know if less bridge or more bridge would have help it or not. Maybe a different angle.</td>', 'Nice shot, the bridge IMO is a little distracting. I don''t know if less bridge or more bridge would have help it or not. Maybe a different angle.', '2009-04-06 13:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
