(5421770, 779730, 101256, '<td valign="top">Amusing - I like a sense of humor. As an image, it''s technically pleasing and while not outstanding, it works. As an out of the box type entry into the challenge, it is delightful. Very clever.</td>', 'Amusing - I like a sense of humor. As an image, it''s technically pleasing and while not outstanding, it works. As an out of the box type entry into the challenge, it is delightful. Very clever.', '2009-04-06 13:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
