(5421962, 779052, 101668, '<td valign="top">Great one</td>', 'Great one', '2009-04-06 15:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421964, 778275, 16106, '<td valign="top">Its a lovely shot, very balanced and polished; but wouldn''t a post card have "atonium" or some such descriptor on it, since this image is not the classical image of the city?  I know its not a major point and more of a graphic design issue than a photographic one, but I think it will hurt your score.</td>', 'Its a lovely shot, very balanced and polished; but wouldn''t a post card have "atonium" or some such descriptor on it, since this image is not the classical image of the city?  I know its not a major point and more of a graphic design issue than a photographic one, but I think it will hurt your score.', '2009-04-06 15:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421967, 779816, 16106, '<td valign="top">Im not sure about the way the sky fades in and out here, the halo around the dome is distracting. Other than that, great choice of subject, beautifully framed, nice use of late afternoon light. top ten.</td>', 'Im not sure about the way the sky fades in and out here, the halo around the dome is distracting. Other than that, great choice of subject, beautifully framed, nice use of late afternoon light. top ten.', '2009-04-06 15:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421975, 779611, 16106, '<td valign="top">What you have here is lovely, but I wish there was more for this challenge. The framing which cuts off the top of the bridge or viaduct keeps the focus on the water, but I wish I could resolve what the structure was. Also the name Healey Dell is fine as a photograph, but is not well enough known world-wide to stand alone. This is a lovely subtle image, but it whispers where postcards tend to shout.</td>', 'What you have here is lovely, but I wish there was more for this challenge. The framing which cuts off the top of the bridge or viaduct keeps the focus on the water, but I wish I could resolve what the structure was. Also the name Healey Dell is fine as a photograph, but is not well enough known world-wide to stand alone. This is a lovely subtle image, but it whispers where postcards tend to shout.', '2009-04-06 15:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421979, 779109, 16106, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field and a classic postcard image, and while postcards to tend toward the supersaturated, the blue of the sky here is a touch overdone, and more importantly it draws the eye away from the Smithsonian, monument and blossoms. Despite that, top ten.</td>', 'Great depth of field and a classic postcard image, and while postcards to tend toward the supersaturated, the blue of the sky here is a touch overdone, and more importantly it draws the eye away from the Smithsonian, monument and blossoms. Despite that, top ten.', '2009-04-06 15:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421981, 779755, 94265, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=70484" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">WriteHeart</a> ?  I think I''d have left out the words at the top but the shot is cool, the blues look great.</td>', ' WriteHeart ?  I think I''d have left out the words at the top but the shot is cool, the blues look great.', '2009-04-06 15:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421985, 779682, 101668, '<td valign="top">Its a great picture but I would not buy a postcard in black and white. I am seldom thrilled by a black and white picture and especially not for a postcard.</td>', 'Its a great picture but I would not buy a postcard in black and white. I am seldom thrilled by a black and white picture and especially not for a postcard.', '2009-04-06 15:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421991, 779460, 16106, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely exposure, but it think it would have looked more "postcard-like" if you had gone for the 4x6 proportions rather than this more squared up crop. That and the blown center on the ferris wheel are the only knocks on this fine image.</td>', 'This is a lovely exposure, but it think it would have looked more "postcard-like" if you had gone for the 4x6 proportions rather than this more squared up crop. That and the blown center on the ferris wheel are the only knocks on this fine image.', '2009-04-06 15:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5421997, 778969, 16106, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why you included the element on the right, but it is distracting without giving me much of a clue as to location. also the OOF twig on the right doesn''t help. Challenges like this are tough when you don''t live near a major tourist attraction, but A bit more thoughful framing would help.</td>', 'I''m not sure why you included the element on the right, but it is distracting without giving me much of a clue as to location. also the OOF twig on the right doesn''t help. Challenges like this are tough when you don''t live near a major tourist attraction, but A bit more thoughful framing would help.', '2009-04-06 15:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422004, 779398, 16106, '<td valign="top">There are alot of entries in this challenge that are better photographs than postcards, this is the opposite. Its a shame that the train is quite so blured, some helps, but this is too much (IMHO). That said everything else , especially the typography is prefect. top ten.</td>', 'There are alot of entries in this challenge that are better photographs than postcards, this is the opposite. Its a shame that the train is quite so blured, some helps, but this is too much (IMHO). That said everything else , especially the typography is prefect. top ten.', '2009-04-06 15:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422006, 779732, 43774, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous night scene, beautiful cityscape. I like your font too.</td>', 'A gorgeous night scene, beautiful cityscape. I like your font too.', '2009-04-06 15:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422008, 779596, 43774, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!! I would buy this postcard (and I am sure I did buy some similar ones when I was there). Love the blue sky, great exposure. Your choice of font is lovely too. One of the two 10''s I gave out.</td>', 'Beautiful!!! I would buy this postcard (and I am sure I did buy some similar ones when I was there). Love the blue sky, great exposure. Your choice of font is lovely too. One of the two 10''s I gave out.', '2009-04-06 15:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
