(5422098, 779766, 101256, '<td valign="top">Ok - this may sound really strange, but why the vertical image and the vertical text? This would have worked with a smaller size on the font and a shorter drop shadow if it were place in either corner of the white space - with is also a problem. The drop shadow wasn''t a great choice either - that just makes your eye water and keep crossing and uncrossing.</td>', 'Ok - this may sound really strange, but why the vertical image and the vertical text? This would have worked with a smaller size on the font and a shorter drop shadow if it were place in either corner of the white space - with is also a problem. The drop shadow wasn''t a great choice either - that just makes your eye water and keep crossing and uncrossing.', '2009-04-06 17:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
