(5422105, 779320, 101256, '<td valign="top">Couldn''t have asked for a better image - perfect font size and selection - perfect use of drop shadow for effect - tight and cogent phrasing - it''s all around a perfect - absoutely perfect, postcard. Well done - congratulations.</td>', 'Couldn''t have asked for a better image - perfect font size and selection - perfect use of drop shadow for effect - tight and cogent phrasing - it''s all around a perfect - absoutely perfect, postcard. Well done - congratulations.', '2009-04-06 17:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
