(5422114, 779816, 101256, '<td valign="top">These last few cards have been terrific - this is another example of proper composition which imparts the feeling of power and grandeur that is our Capital complex. The flag is perfectly positioned along with the soft overall golden glow is simple magic.  The font is perfectly placed and correct - a good choice.</td>', 'These last few cards have been terrific - this is another example of proper composition which imparts the feeling of power and grandeur that is our Capital complex. The flag is perfectly positioned along with the soft overall golden glow is simple magic.  The font is perfectly placed and correct - a good choice.', '2009-04-06 17:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
