(5422117, 779662, 101256, '<td valign="top">As a sportsman, I appreciate images like this. This has some flaws as the background to the landing goose is much too busy - would have been better to use a longer lens and a tighter shot, but it works at it is. The font is a good, solid choice and the white makes it stand out and understandable without impacting the overall impression of the image.</td>', 'As a sportsman, I appreciate images like this. This has some flaws as the background to the landing goose is much too busy - would have been better to use a longer lens and a tighter shot, but it works at it is. The font is a good, solid choice and the white makes it stand out and understandable without impacting the overall impression of the image.', '2009-04-06 17:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422118, 779666, 103032, '<td valign="top">In general, I like the composition, a classic postcard image.  It looks like the sun just set, so the colors of the sky are nice.  However, if someone sent me this postcard, my impression is that Philadelphia must be a ghost town.  The buildings are dark, the bridge is dark.  If the buildings in the skyline were lit up with office lights and the bridge had lights on, I would have a better (positive) impression of the picture and Philadelphia.</td>', 'In general, I like the composition, a classic postcard image.  It looks like the sun just set, so the colors of the sky are nice.  However, if someone sent me this postcard, my impression is that Philadelphia must be a ghost town.  The buildings are dark, the bridge is dark.  If the buildings in the skyline were lit up with office lights and the bridge had lights on, I would have a better (positive) impression of the picture and Philadelphia.', '2009-04-06 17:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422119, 779566, 37444, '<td valign="top">lovely - 8</td>', 'lovely - 8', '2009-04-06 17:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422120, 779102, 37444, '<td valign="top">Great image! 10</td>', 'Great image! 10', '2009-04-06 17:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422121, 779366, 101256, '<td valign="top">An opportunity to recycle a shot from the Flora challenge? I like it as an image - excellant DOF control, very nice colors, image is sharp and has purpose. Not sure wher Spring is located on the map, but what the heck - lots of place I''ve never been.  :&gt;) My only complaint is that while the font selectin is good, the color could be a little more contrasty.</td>', 'An opportunity to recycle a shot from the Flora challenge? I like it as an image - excellant DOF control, very nice colors, image is sharp and has purpose. Not sure wher Spring is located on the map, but what the heck - lots of place I''ve never been.  :>) My only complaint is that while the font selectin is good, the color could be a little more contrasty.', '2009-04-06 17:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
