(5422448, 779611, 80104, '<td valign="top">After scoring and going through these pics I really like yours and have to bump it up a notch to 9.  Don''t know if a bit longer exposure(smaller Aperture or ND filter) would have made for an even nicer shot with the water in the lower pool glazing over.</td>', 'After scoring and going through these pics I really like yours and have to bump it up a notch to 9.  Don''t know if a bit longer exposure(smaller Aperture or ND filter) would have made for an even nicer shot with the water in the lower pool glazing over.', '2009-04-06 18:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422449, 779333, 6405, '<td valign="top">Very pleasant photo, well done !</td>', 'Very pleasant photo, well done !', '2009-04-06 18:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422450, 779775, 80104, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot and viewpoint.  Well done.</td>', 'Very nice shot and viewpoint.  Well done.', '2009-04-06 18:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422453, 779600, 90387, '<td valign="top">Great shot, with a really interesting perspective. the processing also really does the subject justice.  Nice work!</td>', 'Great shot, with a really interesting perspective. the processing also really does the subject justice.  Nice work!', '2009-04-06 18:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422456, 779167, 103818, '<td valign="top">Good use of negative space, well done.</td>', 'Good use of negative space, well done.', '2009-04-06 18:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422458, 779320, 80104, '<td valign="top">Boy.  You''re lucky I scored you a 7 on this one after today.  Beautiful weather yesterday and we get dumped on 10 centimeters today with nasty weather.  Being in radio I have to be the bearer of bad news.  But hey, objectively, it''s nice, it''s very bright and I like it nonetheless.  (Good thing I''m used to snow in April being from father north there where I reside)</td>', 'Boy.  You''re lucky I scored you a 7 on this one after today.  Beautiful weather yesterday and we get dumped on 10 centimeters today with nasty weather.  Being in radio I have to be the bearer of bad news.  But hey, objectively, it''s nice, it''s very bright and I like it nonetheless.  (Good thing I''m used to snow in April being from father north there where I reside)', '2009-04-06 18:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422459, 779069, 80104, '<td valign="top">Very timely shot.  Wished there was a bit more contrast to the picture but nice concept. 6</td>', 'Very timely shot.  Wished there was a bit more contrast to the picture but nice concept. 6', '2009-04-06 18:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422460, 779790, 103032, '<td valign="top">Looks like the picture is tilted down to the right.  Sky looks a bit hazy.</td>', 'Looks like the picture is tilted down to the right.  Sky looks a bit hazy.', '2009-04-06 19:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422461, 779790, 80104, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  Originally a 7 but after further review it''s a nice 8.  Love the silouhette of the mountain on the left bottom corner.  Gives it a nice contrast.</td>', 'Very well done.  Originally a 7 but after further review it''s a nice 8.  Love the silouhette of the mountain on the left bottom corner.  Gives it a nice contrast.', '2009-04-06 19:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422464, 779775, 45857, '<td valign="top">Great colors, would make a wonderful postcard</td>', 'Great colors, would make a wonderful postcard', '2009-04-06 19:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422465, 779224, 80104, '<td valign="top">Well done.  I miss visiting London 10 years ago.  Love the reflection in the Thames.</td>', 'Well done.  I miss visiting London 10 years ago.  Love the reflection in the Thames.', '2009-04-06 19:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422467, 778696, 101256, '<td valign="top">The combination of grayscale and color is very clever and in this challenge, out of the box from what I''ve seen so far.  The font selection and placement compliments the linear form of the image and doesn''t impose itself on the scene at all. Well done.</td>', 'The combination of grayscale and color is very clever and in this challenge, out of the box from what I''ve seen so far.  The font selection and placement compliments the linear form of the image and doesn''t impose itself on the scene at all. Well done.', '2009-04-06 19:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422470, 778696, 35567, '<td valign="top">I like your use of b/w and color in this scene. The only thing that bothers me is that the color to b/w transitions that are not on the waterline make the buildings appear to be cardboard. Also not so sure about the purple sky. But still overall I like it.</td>', 'I like your use of b/w and color in this scene. The only thing that bothers me is that the color to b/w transitions that are not on the waterline make the buildings appear to be cardboard. Also not so sure about the purple sky. But still overall I like it.', '2009-04-06 19:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422472, 779635, 80104, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  Lighting is excellent.  I know it''s not a requirement and some people frown on boarders but I kind of wish there was one to frame this picture.  Maybe a little more spice to the text too.  Would have been a 9 possibly in my book with those adjustments.  However a definite 7 here.  Good work</td>', 'Very nice shot.  Lighting is excellent.  I know it''s not a requirement and some people frown on boarders but I kind of wish there was one to frame this picture.  Maybe a little more spice to the text too.  Would have been a 9 possibly in my book with those adjustments.  However a definite 7 here.  Good work', '2009-04-06 19:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422473, 779640, 35567, '<td valign="top">The sky looks a little odd. It almost looks like it came from another photo.</td>', 'The sky looks a little odd. It almost looks like it came from another photo.', '2009-04-06 19:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422476, 779543, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, nice reflections, nice composition.  But a bit of halos around the buildings.  Can''t put my finger on it, but too much contrast or saturation???  Otherwise nice image.</td>', 'Nice colors, nice reflections, nice composition.  But a bit of halos around the buildings.  Can''t put my finger on it, but too much contrast or saturation???  Otherwise nice image.', '2009-04-06 19:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422478, 779497, 103032, '<td valign="top">Like it. 10</td>', 'Like it. 10', '2009-04-06 19:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422481, 779682, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very impressionistic image and evocative of Norway.  The font selection is good, but it''s placement is problematic and might have worked better higher and in a upper corner.</td>', 'A very impressionistic image and evocative of Norway.  The font selection is good, but it''s placement is problematic and might have worked better higher and in a upper corner.', '2009-04-06 19:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422483, 779502, 35567, '<td valign="top">I like the idea you where shooting for here with the bridge and arches framed within another arch. I think though that the vine really hurts this composition by pulling my eyes away from the bridge and towards what looks like trash on the beach.</td>', 'I like the idea you where shooting for here with the bridge and arches framed within another arch. I think though that the vine really hurts this composition by pulling my eyes away from the bridge and towards what looks like trash on the beach.', '2009-04-06 19:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422485, 779772, 101256, '<td valign="top">A clear crisp image which imparts a sense of place effectively. The font placement was an unfortunate selection and would have worked much better in the larger unused blank space above the bluff.</td>', 'A clear crisp image which imparts a sense of place effectively. The font placement was an unfortunate selection and would have worked much better in the larger unused blank space above the bluff.', '2009-04-06 19:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422486, 779745, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice postcard image.  Everything is sharp/focused.  Good use of the sky for the text.  Nice representative image of Philadelphia.</td>', 'Nice postcard image.  Everything is sharp/focused.  Good use of the sky for the text.  Nice representative image of Philadelphia.', '2009-04-06 19:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422488, 779040, 101256, '<td valign="top">Yep - that''s the Big Sur alright. Very much an iconic image of the area and works well in evoking thoughts of one of the last while places on Earth. The font and placement in the spare space was a good selection. Well done.</td>', 'Yep - that''s the Big Sur alright. Very much an iconic image of the area and works well in evoking thoughts of one of the last while places on Earth. The font and placement in the spare space was a good selection. Well done.', '2009-04-06 19:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422489, 779587, 35567, '<td valign="top">That must of have been a tough shot to get. Would really like to see more detail in the eyes.</td>', 'That must of have been a tough shot to get. Would really like to see more detail in the eyes.', '2009-04-06 19:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422493, 779674, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very simple and elegant - the shapes and forms plus the unigue and soft colors are a good selection. The exposure seems a little over done and could have used treatment in curves to bring them out a little more - that was a side effect of the odd lighting angle. Might have been better to change position and angle just a little.</td>', 'Very simple and elegant - the shapes and forms plus the unigue and soft colors are a good selection. The exposure seems a little over done and could have used treatment in curves to bring them out a little more - that was a side effect of the odd lighting angle. Might have been better to change position and angle just a little.', '2009-04-06 19:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422494, 779682, 35567, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Your placement of the word Norway is very distracting and hard to read but then again this isn''t a page layout contest. 7</td>', 'Great shot! Your placement of the word Norway is very distracting and hard to read but then again this isn''t a page layout contest. 7', '2009-04-06 19:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422496, 779500, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very much as I remembered it from a few years ago.  Very subtle the way you placed the title within the subject - that was inspired. While very colorfull with subtle shapes and forms. An excellant composition with huge impact. Well done.</td>', 'Very much as I remembered it from a few years ago.  Very subtle the way you placed the title within the subject - that was inspired. While very colorfull with subtle shapes and forms. An excellant composition with huge impact. Well done.', '2009-04-06 19:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422499, 779578, 35567, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would have been better served by having the bluebonnets in the foreground in focus as opposed to what looks like the fence being the focal point.</td>', 'I think this shot would have been better served by having the bluebonnets in the foreground in focus as opposed to what looks like the fence being the focal point.', '2009-04-06 19:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422500, 779759, 101256, '<td valign="top">A great image of Arizona and effective.  The font selection and color although it''s placement is somewhat offputting - the author has a lot of blank space, why not use it effectively.</td>', 'A great image of Arizona and effective.  The font selection and color although it''s placement is somewhat offputting - the author has a lot of blank space, why not use it effectively.', '2009-04-06 19:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422501, 779641, 103032, '<td valign="top">Yes, I would be enticed to go see the rocking chair if I got this postcard. I like the cowboy in the foreground, gives it scale. Nice composition.  Good use of the sky for the text.  Nice postcard, well done.</td>', 'Yes, I would be enticed to go see the rocking chair if I got this postcard. I like the cowboy in the foreground, gives it scale. Nice composition.  Good use of the sky for the text.  Nice postcard, well done.', '2009-04-06 19:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422505, 779137, 35567, '<td valign="top">Great shot! I like that the cow is a siluete but that the surounding flowers still have details.</td>', 'Great shot! I like that the cow is a siluete but that the surounding flowers still have details.', '2009-04-06 19:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422507, 779576, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice spin, very creative.</td>', 'Nice spin, very creative.', '2009-04-06 19:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422512, 779153, 101256, '<td valign="top">The unfortunate haze and odd lighting don''t evoke any special feelings for this image as representative of the islands of the Lesser Antilles.</td>', 'The unfortunate haze and odd lighting don''t evoke any special feelings for this image as representative of the islands of the Lesser Antilles.', '2009-04-06 19:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422513, 779109, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice framing with the cherry blossoms.</td>', 'Nice framing with the cherry blossoms.', '2009-04-06 19:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422514, 779102, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another image that perfectly captures the style and times of Colonial Wiliamsburg. Unfortunately, the font selection and size (maybe the color) has a negative impact on the overall excellance of the photographic compositino.  The author might have done better to use the same font in a bolder format or used a different font all together.</td>', 'Another image that perfectly captures the style and times of Colonial Wiliamsburg. Unfortunately, the font selection and size (maybe the color) has a negative impact on the overall excellance of the photographic compositino.  The author might have done better to use the same font in a bolder format or used a different font all together.', '2009-04-06 19:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422515, 779469, 35567, '<td valign="top">I might have been able to score this a little bit higher but the reflections and flash hotspots in the balloons are distracting. Some quick work in photoshop could have quickly eliminated those.</td>', 'I might have been able to score this a little bit higher but the reflections and flash hotspots in the balloons are distracting. Some quick work in photoshop could have quickly eliminated those.', '2009-04-06 19:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422517, 779685, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and effective. The little details are amazing. As an image it works well, but as a post card, I''m not so sure.</td>', 'Very interesting and effective. The little details are amazing. As an image it works well, but as a post card, I''m not so sure.', '2009-04-06 19:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422522, 779149, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice classic image, but looks like a bit of noise got in the sky.</td>', 'Nice classic image, but looks like a bit of noise got in the sky.', '2009-04-06 19:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422523, 779473, 101256, '<td valign="top">The whites are slightly over done which effects the entire effect of impending snow fall. This is a problem with winter images as you can never tell where the light is going to do as it can come from and be reflected from anywhere. The mallards are a very nice touch and add some character to the image which is flat and bland.</td>', 'The whites are slightly over done which effects the entire effect of impending snow fall. This is a problem with winter images as you can never tell where the light is going to do as it can come from and be reflected from anywhere. The mallards are a very nice touch and add some character to the image which is flat and bland.', '2009-04-06 19:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422525, 779715, 103032, '<td valign="top">Too dark.</td>', 'Too dark.', '2009-04-06 19:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422526, 779805, 101256, '<td valign="top">Extremely effective and notable. This is one image where the flowing water meme is efficiently used.  The subtle lighting, reclections and right on the edge highlights are very well done.  The font and placement are almost an afterthought but work well. Well done.</td>', 'Extremely effective and notable. This is one image where the flowing water meme is efficiently used.  The subtle lighting, reclections and right on the edge highlights are very well done.  The font and placement are almost an afterthought but work well. Well done.', '2009-04-06 19:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422528, 778275, 101256, '<td valign="top">Perfect lighting, perfect setting, the reflection is well framed and captured and the font and placement compliments the overall effect of the image. Well done.</td>', 'Perfect lighting, perfect setting, the reflection is well framed and captured and the font and placement compliments the overall effect of the image. Well done.', '2009-04-06 19:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422530, 779656, 101256, '<td valign="top">Richly detailed. A few minor white blooms on the bridge keep it from being a perfect image, but they are so minor it''s a very picky comment. I like the was the frame compliments the image and the font and placement are also complimentary to the image. Well done.</td>', 'Richly detailed. A few minor white blooms on the bridge keep it from being a perfect image, but they are so minor it''s a very picky comment. I like the was the frame compliments the image and the font and placement are also complimentary to the image. Well done.', '2009-04-06 19:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422534, 779472, 101256, '<td valign="top">The image has an HDR enhanced feel to it, but it''s not HDR - it''s just a crisp enjoyable image. The bottom could have a better crop, but the sense of space is very enjoyable and pleasing to the eye. The font is simple and efficient and it''s placement is acceptable.</td>', 'The image has an HDR enhanced feel to it, but it''s not HDR - it''s just a crisp enjoyable image. The bottom could have a better crop, but the sense of space is very enjoyable and pleasing to the eye. The font is simple and efficient and it''s placement is acceptable.', '2009-04-06 19:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422538, 779675, 101256, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a little soft, but the way the light was handled with the minor lens flare is very effective. The little lens flare in the left hand corner is a little distracting and the little flares from the ice crystals detract from the image''s overall impact. It is effective in imparting a sense of what Iceland is all about.</td>', 'The focus seems a little soft, but the way the light was handled with the minor lens flare is very effective. The little lens flare in the left hand corner is a little distracting and the little flares from the ice crystals detract from the image''s overall impact. It is effective in imparting a sense of what Iceland is all about.', '2009-04-06 19:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422562, 779786, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice, a classic postcard image.  Again, I like these images where you can actually see the buildings against the sky. Great focus on the main subject. Good use of dead space for the text.  10</td>', 'Nice, a classic postcard image.  Again, I like these images where you can actually see the buildings against the sky. Great focus on the main subject. Good use of dead space for the text.  10', '2009-04-06 19:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422572, 779754, 96823, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I think the colors needed to be a little richer IMO.</td>', 'Nice shot, I think the colors needed to be a little richer IMO.', '2009-04-06 20:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422578, 779810, 96823, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, IMO a flower or flowers would have made it better.</td>', 'Nice shot, IMO a flower or flowers would have made it better.', '2009-04-06 20:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422579, 779702, 45857, '<td valign="top">Great postcard</td>', 'Great postcard', '2009-04-06 20:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
