(5422588, 779754, 101256, '<td valign="top">A excellant portrayal of the Land Down Under.  The feeling is that the focus is a little soft, but it''s not - it''s the effect of the grass. Good font selection and placement.</td>', 'A excellant portrayal of the Land Down Under.  The feeling is that the focus is a little soft, but it''s not - it''s the effect of the grass. Good font selection and placement.', '2009-04-06 20:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
