(5422593, 779607, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very effective in that I would very much like to vist a scene like this.  the image is soft, but it works to entice. The font isn''t as effective as it could be - it''s much darker than necessary and a change in color would have a positive impact.</td>', 'Very effective in that I would very much like to vist a scene like this.  the image is soft, but it works to entice. The font isn''t as effective as it could be - it''s much darker than necessary and a change in color would have a positive impact.', '2009-04-06 20:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
