(5422605, 779587, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not perfect, but imperfectly perfect.  The whole effect of the image is positive even with the little imperfections that nobody would notice unless one were being overly critical. The thought expressed is well thought out and the font and color work well.</td>', 'Not perfect, but imperfectly perfect.  The whole effect of the image is positive even with the little imperfections that nobody would notice unless one were being overly critical. The thought expressed is well thought out and the font and color work well.', '2009-04-06 20:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
