(5422664, 779805, 96823, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!</td>', 'Nicely done!', '2009-04-06 20:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422665, 779149, 79955, '<td valign="top">No vote, just commenting. This is a great shot , makes a perfect postcard. the colors are great. Though I feel that the font &amp; font color selection could have been improved.</td>', 'No vote, just commenting. This is a great shot , makes a perfect postcard. the colors are great. Though I feel that the font & font color selection could have been improved.', '2009-04-06 20:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422666, 779719, 101256, '<td valign="top">The image is very effective even with the slightly over done white lights - very moody and representative of the city. The font works, but I wouldn''t have used the drop shadow in that fashion.  It might have worked better if you had used an embossed font or a different font with a more 3D effect to match the depth and quality of the image.</td>', 'The image is very effective even with the slightly over done white lights - very moody and representative of the city. The font works, but I wouldn''t have used the drop shadow in that fashion.  It might have worked better if you had used an embossed font or a different font with a more 3D effect to match the depth and quality of the image.', '2009-04-06 20:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422667, 779283, 96823, '<td valign="top">nice shot.</td>', 'nice shot.', '2009-04-06 20:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422670, 779807, 79955, '<td valign="top">no vote, just commenting. the composition is very nice. Needs a little more contrast &amp; punch for a postcard IMO</td>', 'no vote, just commenting. the composition is very nice. Needs a little more contrast & punch for a postcard IMO', '2009-04-06 20:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422672, 779274, 79955, '<td valign="top">no vote , just commenting. I feel that you cropped too tight at the top. Need a little more boost in the colors and a little more sharpness/contrast to make for an interesting postcard</td>', 'no vote , just commenting. I feel that you cropped too tight at the top. Need a little more boost in the colors and a little more sharpness/contrast to make for an interesting postcard', '2009-04-06 20:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422679, 779711, 101256, '<td valign="top">Napatree Beach towards Watch Hill light - don''t see that often at all. Terrific imagery with the tripod shadow and the golden light. The author has captured the very essence of this area of the Atlantic and New England.  The font is perfect.  Well done.</td>', 'Napatree Beach towards Watch Hill light - don''t see that often at all. Terrific imagery with the tripod shadow and the golden light. The author has captured the very essence of this area of the Atlantic and New England.  The font is perfect.  Well done.', '2009-04-06 20:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422680, 779667, 101256, '<td valign="top">Other than salute the author for an excellant image, nothing more needs to be said - perfect composition and very emotional. Well done.</td>', 'Other than salute the author for an excellant image, nothing more needs to be said - perfect composition and very emotional. Well done.', '2009-04-06 20:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422681, 779773, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another outstanding entry and a favorite - should be a top ten contender. The font mix is perfect and very well placed.</td>', 'Another outstanding entry and a favorite - should be a top ten contender. The font mix is perfect and very well placed.', '2009-04-06 20:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422685, 779359, 101256, '<td valign="top">The yellow is a little over the edge. The font treatment is very effective and clever. Overall the image is crip and sharp although where is here? :&gt;)</td>', 'The yellow is a little over the edge. The font treatment is very effective and clever. Overall the image is crip and sharp although where is here? :>)', '2009-04-06 20:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422688, 779636, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very pleasant mix of color and style - almost iconic. Highlights are right on the edge which is a plus.  The bill board is a distaction, but not completely a negative. The font mix is well thought out and it works very well. Well done.</td>', 'A very pleasant mix of color and style - almost iconic. Highlights are right on the edge which is a plus.  The bill board is a distaction, but not completely a negative. The font mix is well thought out and it works very well. Well done.', '2009-04-06 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422692, 779628, 101256, '<td valign="top">An appropriate treatment of this location. The font and it''s placement outside the image treat the image with the respect it deserves. Very pleasant to look at and not commercial. Well done.</td>', 'An appropriate treatment of this location. The font and it''s placement outside the image treat the image with the respect it deserves. Very pleasant to look at and not commercial. Well done.', '2009-04-06 20:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422698, 779156, 101256, '<td valign="top">Effective treatment with the bridge only emphasizing the depth and grandeur of the gorge. The font works, but it''s placement is suspect - it might have worked better with complimentary colors to the color tones of the image - the red and yellow just jump out at you and they don''t treat the image with any respect.</td>', 'Effective treatment with the bridge only emphasizing the depth and grandeur of the gorge. The font works, but it''s placement is suspect - it might have worked better with complimentary colors to the color tones of the image - the red and yellow just jump out at you and they don''t treat the image with any respect.', '2009-04-06 20:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422705, 779460, 101256, '<td valign="top">What is it with you Aussies and the great images y''all produce? :&gt;)  The highlights are a little over done and the central ferris wheel bloom draws the eye away form the rest of the almost perfect image. The font selection is good, but the color should be a little more subdued - that''s a personal selection as it works are it is. Nice composition and good execution with a couple of minor issues.</td>', 'What is it with you Aussies and the great images y''all produce? :>)  The highlights are a little over done and the central ferris wheel bloom draws the eye away form the rest of the almost perfect image. The font selection is good, but the color should be a little more subdued - that''s a personal selection as it works are it is. Nice composition and good execution with a couple of minor issues.', '2009-04-06 20:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422707, 779627, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''m not going to say anything other than perfect - absoutely perfect top to bottom, right to left. Wonderful.</td>', 'I''m not going to say anything other than perfect - absoutely perfect top to bottom, right to left. Wonderful.', '2009-04-06 20:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422713, 779800, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is so iconic of SE Missouri - I can''t say enough about the way the author handles this image from the font to the overall feel of a great wetlands area.</td>', 'This is so iconic of SE Missouri - I can''t say enough about the way the author handles this image from the font to the overall feel of a great wetlands area.', '2009-04-06 20:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422715, 779374, 101256, '<td valign="top">Amusing and definetly out of the box. Well done.</td>', 'Amusing and definetly out of the box. Well done.', '2009-04-06 20:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422722, 779523, 101256, '<td valign="top">The author has treated the stand alone arches of the Abbey with a very different angle and it''s effective. A good font choice, although a slightly more ornate font would be more suitable. Balanced and effective.</td>', 'The author has treated the stand alone arches of the Abbey with a very different angle and it''s effective. A good font choice, although a slightly more ornate font would be more suitable. Balanced and effective.', '2009-04-06 21:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422733, 779529, 101256, '<td valign="top">This works in so many different ways - terrific imagery and very unique.</td>', 'This works in so many different ways - terrific imagery and very unique.', '2009-04-06 21:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422738, 777965, 101256, '<td valign="top">The combination of vibrant color and rather bland background isn''t very effective. The cell tower and satillite dishes are also a distraction. This would work as a political statement though if one chose to comment on nature vs modern life.</td>', 'The combination of vibrant color and rather bland background isn''t very effective. The cell tower and satillite dishes are also a distraction. This would work as a political statement though if one chose to comment on nature vs modern life.', '2009-04-06 21:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422747, 779460, 31637, '<td valign="top">Great colors, the buildings are too dark, some tonal range on the buildings and a dramatic sky would have helped your score alot.</td>', 'Great colors, the buildings are too dark, some tonal range on the buildings and a dramatic sky would have helped your score alot.', '2009-04-06 21:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422756, 779788, 31637, '<td valign="top">I love the tones here, nice postcard!</td>', 'I love the tones here, nice postcard!', '2009-04-06 21:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422757, 779802, 101256, '<td valign="top">A lot of blank space and too much blue.  The frame also disappear at the bottom - might have been better to use black or a deeper color to make it effective. The font is fine, but the placement is problematic - it would have been better on the right to fillin some space.</td>', 'A lot of blank space and too much blue.  The frame also disappear at the bottom - might have been better to use black or a deeper color to make it effective. The font is fine, but the placement is problematic - it would have been better on the right to fillin some space.', '2009-04-06 21:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422758, 779769, 31637, '<td valign="top">Great job with the font graphics.</td>', 'Great job with the font graphics.', '2009-04-06 21:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422760, 779649, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very whimisical and effective. As a statement of time, it works very well - place also depending on what would be on the back.  Different from the norm in this challenge and well thought out.</td>', 'Very whimisical and effective. As a statement of time, it works very well - place also depending on what would be on the back.  Different from the norm in this challenge and well thought out.', '2009-04-06 21:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422766, 779600, 101256, '<td valign="top">Perfet composition.  The dramatic angles, the crisp sharp image and excellant tone control with the off color cast is very inventive. The font and placement isn''t the best as the white contrasts too much with the excellant imagery.</td>', 'Perfet composition.  The dramatic angles, the crisp sharp image and excellant tone control with the off color cast is very inventive. The font and placement isn''t the best as the white contrasts too much with the excellant imagery.', '2009-04-06 21:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422771, 778712, 101256, '<td valign="top">As an image it''s very impressionistic and post modern.  The sun was handled very well, but the overly dark bottom of what can be assumed as a beach lacks detail to give the image some depth and appeal.</td>', 'As an image it''s very impressionistic and post modern.  The sun was handled very well, but the overly dark bottom of what can be assumed as a beach lacks detail to give the image some depth and appeal.', '2009-04-06 21:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422773, 779814, 101256, '<td valign="top">Effective use of shutter speed and aperature to control the background. A good solid commercial shot. There are actualy two images here if it were split in two vertically which is always a plus.  The font is a good selection, placement is perfet and the overall laid back impression is positive.  Well done.</td>', 'Effective use of shutter speed and aperature to control the background. A good solid commercial shot. There are actualy two images here if it were split in two vertically which is always a plus.  The font is a good selection, placement is perfet and the overall laid back impression is positive.  Well done.', '2009-04-06 21:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422775, 779804, 101256, '<td valign="top">It''s The Librarian from Unseen University again!! Wonderful, very effective, sharp, crisp and utterly charming. The font selection and placement is perfect. Well done.</td>', 'It''s The Librarian from Unseen University again!! Wonderful, very effective, sharp, crisp and utterly charming. The font selection and placement is perfect. Well done.', '2009-04-06 21:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422777, 779497, 31637, '<td valign="top">Hot Pasta I assume? What a great image, and your processing makes it an excellent postcard as well. Both your tones and colors are contrasted perfectly, exposed well throughout. Oh and the different types of fonts might bother some picky voters, but im not nitpicking..8</td>', 'Hot Pasta I assume? What a great image, and your processing makes it an excellent postcard as well. Both your tones and colors are contrasted perfectly, exposed well throughout. Oh and the different types of fonts might bother some picky voters, but im not nitpicking..8', '2009-04-06 21:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422778, 779730, 102315, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the "wish you were here" text works for a cemetery shot. Unless you were sending it to someone you hated?</td>', 'I don''t think the "wish you were here" text works for a cemetery shot. Unless you were sending it to someone you hated?', '2009-04-06 21:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422781, 779656, 31637, '<td valign="top">Very sharp, however, I''d rather see this in color I think.</td>', 'Very sharp, however, I''d rather see this in color I think.', '2009-04-06 21:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
