(5422789, 779224, 31637, '<td valign="top">Nice font for this, too bad the sky is so dark.</td>', 'Nice font for this, too bad the sky is so dark.', '2009-04-06 21:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422790, 779175, 31637, '<td valign="top">Awesome textures brought out here. But DNMC is what I think of first.</td>', 'Awesome textures brought out here. But DNMC is what I think of first.', '2009-04-06 21:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422792, 779197, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another dramatic and provacative image. Excellant tone control, excellant shot selection - the overall impact is very positive. The upper location font is a good selection and the embossed effect is a tad overdone. The bottom font is also a good selection, but the length of the sentence detracts from the scene in a significant way.</td>', 'Another dramatic and provacative image. Excellant tone control, excellant shot selection - the overall impact is very positive. The upper location font is a good selection and the embossed effect is a tad overdone. The bottom font is also a good selection, but the length of the sentence detracts from the scene in a significant way.', '2009-04-06 21:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422797, 779484, 101256, '<td valign="top">This works great even with the over large font.  The gentle gliding river is very effective and the soft flow of the light on the building is very effective. The details on the tower and clock are perfect. Very well done.</td>', 'This works great even with the over large font.  The gentle gliding river is very effective and the soft flow of the light on the building is very effective. The details on the tower and clock are perfect. Very well done.', '2009-04-06 21:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422800, 778354, 101256, '<td valign="top">The image has a soft focus which works - maybe a by product of HDR processing?  the image is effective though and that is a plus. The bottom border is well executed, but detracts from the image. If the image were sharper, it wouldn''t be as distracting.</td>', 'The image has a soft focus which works - maybe a by product of HDR processing?  the image is effective though and that is a plus. The bottom border is well executed, but detracts from the image. If the image were sharper, it wouldn''t be as distracting.', '2009-04-06 21:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422801, 778609, 101256, '<td valign="top">Yes it is Monument Valley and one of the best treatments I''ve seen in a while. Excellant font selection and placement. A perfectly saleable image for a post card. Well done.</td>', 'Yes it is Monument Valley and one of the best treatments I''ve seen in a while. Excellant font selection and placement. A perfectly saleable image for a post card. Well done.', '2009-04-06 21:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422802, 779629, 98647, '<td valign="top">Lovely skyline. The wheel spoils it a little for me though. Still nicely done.</td>', 'Lovely skyline. The wheel spoils it a little for me though. Still nicely done.', '2009-04-06 21:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422803, 779470, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another excellant treatment of an iconic area of the world. Lush greens and yellows only serve to compliment the earth tones of the columns. The font is a great selection to compliment the columns. Well done.</td>', 'Another excellant treatment of an iconic area of the world. Lush greens and yellows only serve to compliment the earth tones of the columns. The font is a great selection to compliment the columns. Well done.', '2009-04-06 21:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422804, 778836, 98647, '<td valign="top">Lovely macro. Great colours, and perfect focus.</td>', 'Lovely macro. Great colours, and perfect focus.', '2009-04-06 21:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422805, 779137, 31637, '<td valign="top">great shot, your text is bland for a postcard, but ill vote on the image..6</td>', 'great shot, your text is bland for a postcard, but ill vote on the image..6', '2009-04-06 21:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422808, 779333, 101256, '<td valign="top">A terrific image with contrasting color and tone. Very effective treatment of a city scape. A proper font and color for this would need custom treatment to compliment the image itself.</td>', 'A terrific image with contrasting color and tone. Very effective treatment of a city scape. A proper font and color for this would need custom treatment to compliment the image itself.', '2009-04-06 21:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422812, 779543, 101256, '<td valign="top">When reviewing competitions like this, city scapes seem to be the thing to do and it''s hard to view another image and stay fresh while reviewing so that you give the authors a fair shake.  Then up comes a fresh treatment of a city scape and you are renewed. This is one of those images that, while similar to the others, is very different in how it was handled. The reflections are perfect and compliment the light and structures in a pleasing way. The subtle change from brilliant colors to pastels on the water is very pleasing to the eye. The font is good, the color might have been a little more subtle to compliment the image.  Well done.</td>', 'When reviewing competitions like this, city scapes seem to be the thing to do and it''s hard to view another image and stay fresh while reviewing so that you give the authors a fair shake.  Then up comes a fresh treatment of a city scape and you are renewed. This is one of those images that, while similar to the others, is very different in how it was handled. The reflections are perfect and compliment the light and structures in a pleasing way. The subtle change from brilliant colors to pastels on the water is very pleasing to the eye. The font is good, the color might have been a little more subtle to compliment the image.  Well done.', '2009-04-06 21:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422813, 779497, 98647, '<td valign="top">Love the blue and the fonts really work. Just wish the buildings were parallel to the edges.</td>', 'Love the blue and the fonts really work. Just wish the buildings were parallel to the edges.', '2009-04-06 21:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422816, 779753, 98647, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of big frames, but it works well here. It actually looks like a postcard.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of big frames, but it works well here. It actually looks like a postcard.', '2009-04-06 21:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422818, 779819, 101256, '<td valign="top">I was trying to think of where Twispwa was, then I got it. :&gt;) Missing a comma. A nice image, interesting lighting and fairly well detailed although a bit uninteresting.</td>', 'I was trying to think of where Twispwa was, then I got it. :>) Missing a comma. A nice image, interesting lighting and fairly well detailed although a bit uninteresting.', '2009-04-06 21:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422821, 778969, 101256, '<td valign="top">A busy image and not very well focused - it''s really a DOF problem. The font and color are difficult to read. this might have worked better if taken in large format .jpg or RAW and cropped to center on the birds.</td>', 'A busy image and not very well focused - it''s really a DOF problem. The font and color are difficult to read. this might have worked better if taken in large format .jpg or RAW and cropped to center on the birds.', '2009-04-06 21:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422824, 777998, 101256, '<td valign="top">Delightfully whimsical imagery. The font was an unfortunate selection as it interfers with the sand and looks incomplete - the same font in a full bold or solid would have helped a lot. The font color is fine and works well with the rest of the image.</td>', 'Delightfully whimsical imagery. The font was an unfortunate selection as it interfers with the sand and looks incomplete - the same font in a full bold or solid would have helped a lot. The font color is fine and works well with the rest of the image.', '2009-04-06 21:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422826, 779611, 101256, '<td valign="top">What can I say - a top ten entry in this challenge.</td>', 'What can I say - a top ten entry in this challenge.', '2009-04-06 21:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422828, 779512, 101256, '<td valign="top">Terrific detail and very effective message.  I can''t even find a nit to pick.<br/>A top ten entry in the challenge for sure.</td>', 'Terrific detail and very effective message.  I can''t even find a nit to pick.A top ten entry in the challenge for sure.', '2009-04-06 21:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422830, 779682, 98647, '<td valign="top">I like the movement with the birds, but I don''t see it as a postcard because of the black and white and the size.</td>', 'I like the movement with the birds, but I don''t see it as a postcard because of the black and white and the size.', '2009-04-06 21:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422833, 779700, 98647, '<td valign="top">It would have been nice to have some negative space to place the text. It doesn''t really stand out as it is.</td>', 'It would have been nice to have some negative space to place the text. It doesn''t really stand out as it is.', '2009-04-06 21:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422838, 779587, 98647, '<td valign="top">Interesting caption. The shot is a bit busy though.</td>', 'Interesting caption. The shot is a bit busy though.', '2009-04-06 22:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422844, 779740, 101256, '<td valign="top">A great image of the sportsmen''s paradise that is Ontario. The font selection is good, but a little more contrast with a different color other than a pastel would have worked better.</td>', 'A great image of the sportsmen''s paradise that is Ontario. The font selection is good, but a little more contrast with a different color other than a pastel would have worked better.', '2009-04-06 22:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422847, 779726, 98647, '<td valign="top">As far as the shot goes, it''s a bit soft and the bokeh on the upper right is distracting. As far as the challenge goes, it isn''t quite what I think of when I think Australia.</td>', 'As far as the shot goes, it''s a bit soft and the bokeh on the upper right is distracting. As far as the challenge goes, it isn''t quite what I think of when I think Australia.', '2009-04-06 22:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422848, 779704, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good image of an architectural icon. The angle is odd and gives the impression of going uphill, but it is level. Very well composed and executed.</td>', 'A good image of an architectural icon. The angle is odd and gives the impression of going uphill, but it is level. Very well composed and executed.', '2009-04-06 22:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422849, 779157, 101256, '<td valign="top">A duplicate image that isn''t as impressive or as dramatic as the other. Good font selection and placement.</td>', 'A duplicate image that isn''t as impressive or as dramatic as the other. Good font selection and placement.', '2009-04-06 22:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422852, 779175, 98647, '<td valign="top">I like the processing. Wouldn''t buy it as a postcard though.</td>', 'I like the processing. Wouldn''t buy it as a postcard though.', '2009-04-06 22:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422853, 778116, 101256, '<td valign="top">A solid image evoking the theme of rural England. A nice pleasing font with the gentle sweep into the border shoulnd''t work but it does. Nice and crips image with plenty of detail.</td>', 'A solid image evoking the theme of rural England. A nice pleasing font with the gentle sweep into the border shoulnd''t work but it does. Nice and crips image with plenty of detail.', '2009-04-06 22:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422856, 779398, 101256, '<td valign="top">A different scene and a perfect representation of a theme park from the font to placement to the crisp, sharp scene with movement. Well done.</td>', 'A different scene and a perfect representation of a theme park from the font to placement to the crisp, sharp scene with movement. Well done.', '2009-04-06 22:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422859, 778060, 101256, '<td valign="top">A modern image for a modern arts building.  A perfect post card image - the font and placement are not intruding into the scene and is very subtle. A top ten image.</td>', 'A modern image for a modern arts building.  A perfect post card image - the font and placement are not intruding into the scene and is very subtle. A top ten image.', '2009-04-06 22:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422861, 779771, 101256, '<td valign="top">A professional quality image which demonstrates the oeuvre of the tourist themed venue. The font and color are a good selection and the placement in a seperate bordered area at the bottom is a good way to not intrude into the image. Well done.</td>', 'A professional quality image which demonstrates the oeuvre of the tourist themed venue. The font and color are a good selection and the placement in a seperate bordered area at the bottom is a good way to not intrude into the image. Well done.', '2009-04-06 22:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422863, 779774, 101256, '<td valign="top">Perfect - just too perfect. I can''t say enough about this - it''s clever, a really solid composition that is effective in demonstrating how America loves its game from the time we start to walk. And on opening day too!! Well done.</td>', 'Perfect - just too perfect. I can''t say enough about this - it''s clever, a really solid composition that is effective in demonstrating how America loves its game from the time we start to walk. And on opening day too!! Well done.', '2009-04-06 22:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422866, 779482, 101256, '<td valign="top">Excellant - another great image and treatment from Down Under. A top ten image in the challenge.</td>', 'Excellant - another great image and treatment from Down Under. A top ten image in the challenge.', '2009-04-06 22:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422882, 779822, 101256, '<td valign="top">A terrific image - the setting in perfect and the total effect is one of a natural setting perfect for a zoo.  More thought with respect to the font, font color/size and placement would have been better, but what is there does work, it just doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'A terrific image - the setting in perfect and the total effect is one of a natural setting perfect for a zoo.  More thought with respect to the font, font color/size and placement would have been better, but what is there does work, it just doesn''t work for me.', '2009-04-06 22:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422885, 779586, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good image, but the top down shadow effects the image negatively. The details disappear into the dark and that''s a negative. I''m not sure why that happened, but it''s distracting.</td>', 'A good image, but the top down shadow effects the image negatively. The details disappear into the dark and that''s a negative. I''m not sure why that happened, but it''s distracting.', '2009-04-06 22:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422886, 779497, 96664, '<td valign="top">This could be my favorite! Well done! GREAT colors!</td>', 'This could be my favorite! Well done! GREAT colors!', '2009-04-06 22:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422887, 779725, 101256, '<td valign="top">A nice image, but lacking context in terms of being a post card.</td>', 'A nice image, but lacking context in terms of being a post card.', '2009-04-06 22:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422892, 779577, 101256, '<td valign="top">After seeing a number of these very similar images from Sydney to Seattle to Hong Kong to Malaysia, you get a little jaded and tired trying to treat each one as unique and giving the entries the respect they deserve.  Then there is this - its similar, yet different in detail.  The Chicago 2016 theme is a good one and it works well. It might have helped to put Chicago 2016 somewhere in the image or in a border along the bottom, but the image works as it is - very well composed, no a single highlight blow out, nice mix of tone and shades of tones - is a great one.  Well done.</td>', 'After seeing a number of these very similar images from Sydney to Seattle to Hong Kong to Malaysia, you get a little jaded and tired trying to treat each one as unique and giving the entries the respect they deserve.  Then there is this - its similar, yet different in detail.  The Chicago 2016 theme is a good one and it works well. It might have helped to put Chicago 2016 somewhere in the image or in a border along the bottom, but the image works as it is - very well composed, no a single highlight blow out, nice mix of tone and shades of tones - is a great one.  Well done.', '2009-04-06 22:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422893, 779616, 101256, '<td valign="top">A little less space in the foreground would have helped this image and created a more dynamic impact with the cityscape in the background. The font selection is good and a good contrasting color.</td>', 'A little less space in the foreground would have helped this image and created a more dynamic impact with the cityscape in the background. The font selection is good and a good contrasting color.', '2009-04-06 22:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422895, 779502, 101256, '<td valign="top">The dangling vine doesn''t help this image much at all. It would have helped to move it out of the way.  I do like the concept and the idea behind the composition, but the execution fails to impress. The font and placement is good.</td>', 'The dangling vine doesn''t help this image much at all. It would have helped to move it out of the way.  I do like the concept and the idea behind the composition, but the execution fails to impress. The font and placement is good.', '2009-04-06 22:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422897, 779672, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very good impression of the out doors and Minnesota in general. The font is a good selection and it''s placement is efficient and effective. A good representative post card for the Land of 10,000 Lakes and in particular Lake Woebegone.</td>', 'A very good impression of the out doors and Minnesota in general. The font is a good selection and it''s placement is efficient and effective. A good representative post card for the Land of 10,000 Lakes and in particular Lake Woebegone.', '2009-04-06 22:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422908, 779666, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic image, but it would have helped to have some light in the city itself. It''s also not emblematic of Philadelphia as it''s similar to several photographs in this challenge.</td>', 'Very dramatic image, but it would have helped to have some light in the city itself. It''s also not emblematic of Philadelphia as it''s similar to several photographs in this challenge.', '2009-04-06 22:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422910, 778836, 101256, '<td valign="top">Out of the box thinking and a very amusing and highly entertaining image. Well done.</td>', 'Out of the box thinking and a very amusing and highly entertaining image. Well done.', '2009-04-06 22:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422912, 779327, 101256, '<td valign="top">This would make a good background image for a hunting lodge card or similar. The little white blooms typical of a snow shot are distracting - not by much though.</td>', 'This would make a good background image for a hunting lodge card or similar. The little white blooms typical of a snow shot are distracting - not by much though.', '2009-04-06 22:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422915, 779780, 101256, '<td valign="top">A sense of space and wilderness - that river just begs to be explored and fished. The use of a subtle font and color enhances the overall effect. Very nicely executed.</td>', 'A sense of space and wilderness - that river just begs to be explored and fished. The use of a subtle font and color enhances the overall effect. Very nicely executed.', '2009-04-06 22:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422916, 779753, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very clever and unique. The font and drop shadow compliment the overall effect of what the author wanted to convey as an impression of Canada.</td>', 'Very clever and unique. The font and drop shadow compliment the overall effect of what the author wanted to convey as an impression of Canada.', '2009-04-06 22:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422918, 779566, 101256, '<td valign="top">A terrific greeting card - it would work for almost anything at any time. Soft, subtle.  The font choice and color perfectly compliment the image. A top ten entry in the challenge.</td>', 'A terrific greeting card - it would work for almost anything at any time. Soft, subtle.  The font choice and color perfectly compliment the image. A top ten entry in the challenge.', '2009-04-06 22:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422922, 779769, 101256, '<td valign="top">There is just one thing wrong with this image and that''s the top title - it flaws an other wise spectacular image and good use of other fonts and placement.  The top font should stand out just a little more to make it a completely effective and dramatic representation of a natural wonder.</td>', 'There is just one thing wrong with this image and that''s the top title - it flaws an other wise spectacular image and good use of other fonts and placement.  The top font should stand out just a little more to make it a completely effective and dramatic representation of a natural wonder.', '2009-04-06 22:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422925, 779823, 101256, '<td valign="top">The whole pastel tone of this is Miami - a perfect representation. The singluar flaw is the white bloom on the palm tree - it draws the eye away from the rest of the image and severely impacts the overall effect.  The author might have done better to clone out the white bloom or crop it out entirely. Crockett and Tubbs would have approved of this image.</td>', 'The whole pastel tone of this is Miami - a perfect representation. The singluar flaw is the white bloom on the palm tree - it draws the eye away from the rest of the image and severely impacts the overall effect.  The author might have done better to clone out the white bloom or crop it out entirely. Crockett and Tubbs would have approved of this image.', '2009-04-06 23:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422927, 779808, 101256, '<td valign="top">A unique entry and well appreciated. Very effective and representative. Good font selection and placement. A top ten entry.</td>', 'A unique entry and well appreciated. Very effective and representative. Good font selection and placement. A top ten entry.', '2009-04-06 23:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422930, 779801, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another unigue image and very out side the normal images one would associate with a place. A work of art nicely composed and executed.</td>', 'Another unigue image and very out side the normal images one would associate with a place. A work of art nicely composed and executed.', '2009-04-06 23:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422931, 779717, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another very different image well thought out, composed and executed. The capture is very efficient in it''s imagery and represents the rural nature of most states.  The font selection and placement is good.</td>', 'Another very different image well thought out, composed and executed. The capture is very efficient in it''s imagery and represents the rural nature of most states.  The font selection and placement is good.', '2009-04-06 23:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422933, 779200, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very intriguing treatment of space - it''s empty, yet the single character seems to fill the void remarkably well. The subtle pastel drop shadow is perfectly executed. A good image to represent a new view of South Africa. Well done.</td>', 'A very intriguing treatment of space - it''s empty, yet the single character seems to fill the void remarkably well. The subtle pastel drop shadow is perfectly executed. A good image to represent a new view of South Africa. Well done.', '2009-04-06 23:06:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5422935, 779351, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another terrific application of grayscale and color. I can''t find a flaw that even remotely impacts the image. Perfect font selection and placement. Well done and certainly a top 15 image if not a top ten.</td>', 'Another terrific application of grayscale and color. I can''t find a flaw that even remotely impacts the image. Perfect font selection and placement. Well done and certainly a top 15 image if not a top ten.', '2009-04-06 23:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422946, 779736, 101256, '<td valign="top">A clever reference to cheese - or not. :&gt;)  A great image, but I can''t imagine using it as a vacation post card. I''m not sure how it meets the challenge as it seems way outside the central theme.</td>', 'A clever reference to cheese - or not. :>)  A great image, but I can''t imagine using it as a vacation post card. I''m not sure how it meets the challenge as it seems way outside the central theme.', '2009-04-06 23:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422956, 779533, 101256, '<td valign="top">A modern treatment of a modernist village. Excellant treatment of the unigue nature of this series of buildings. The font and color work very well.</td>', 'A modern treatment of a modernist village. Excellant treatment of the unigue nature of this series of buildings. The font and color work very well.', '2009-04-06 23:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422962, 779726, 101256, '<td valign="top">A great macro and a scene very unique to this challenge. Great DOF control on the insect. Different and intriguing. Very good capture and presentation.</td>', 'A great macro and a scene very unique to this challenge. Great DOF control on the insect. Different and intriguing. Very good capture and presentation.', '2009-04-06 23:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422970, 779067, 101256, '<td valign="top">The pastels work well, but the author is fighting a rather bland and featureless sky as a background - it is a deficit that the rather interesting subject cannot over come. Font choice and color compliments the subject''s subtle color tones.</td>', 'The pastels work well, but the author is fighting a rather bland and featureless sky as a background - it is a deficit that the rather interesting subject cannot over come. Font choice and color compliments the subject''s subtle color tones.', '2009-04-06 23:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422986, 779730, 61552, '<td valign="top">Good one!</td>', 'Good one!', '2009-04-06 23:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422988, 779790, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very nice capture from Presidio and is very representative of San Francisco in general. The font and it''s treatment is perfect and matches the overall feeling of the image. The highlights are perfectly on the edge and compliment the image.  Well done.</td>', 'A very nice capture from Presidio and is very representative of San Francisco in general. The font and it''s treatment is perfect and matches the overall feeling of the image. The highlights are perfectly on the edge and compliment the image.  Well done.', '2009-04-06 23:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422993, 779226, 101256, '<td valign="top">The bottom font is a touch over done - a little smaller and it would improve the image. Having said that, it works very well as it is.  The little image details like the eyes are amazing. A top fifteen image if not top ten.</td>', 'The bottom font is a touch over done - a little smaller and it would improve the image. Having said that, it works very well as it is.  The little image details like the eyes are amazing. A top fifteen image if not top ten.', '2009-04-06 23:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422995, 779786, 101256, '<td valign="top">I can''t find a single issue with this - the font is a good choice and it''s properly placed, the whites are right on the edge, everything is sharp and clear and not over sharpened. A variable amount of light and color in the background and the subject is perfectly framed. Well done.</td>', 'I can''t find a single issue with this - the font is a good choice and it''s properly placed, the whites are right on the edge, everything is sharp and clear and not over sharpened. A variable amount of light and color in the background and the subject is perfectly framed. Well done.', '2009-04-06 23:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5422998, 779825, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another great example of form meeting function and matching exactly. Perfect image - the highlighted generic font style works very well, the subject matter is perfect, colors are what they should be and the image itself is crips, sharp and very nicely composed. A perfect postcard. Well done.</td>', 'Another great example of form meeting function and matching exactly. Perfect image - the highlighted generic font style works very well, the subject matter is perfect, colors are what they should be and the image itself is crips, sharp and very nicely composed. A perfect postcard. Well done.', '2009-04-06 23:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5423000, 778684, 101256, '<td valign="top">Yowza!! Wonderful image - the white are right on the edge, the star effect is a very deft touch and the colored arch shadows are - unbelivable.  I completely understand your reluctance to put a font on the image - it wouldn''t do a thing for the image at all.  This would also be a great Chamber of Commerce image - might want to see if you can seel it to them. :&gt;)<br/> <br/>I don''t have sufficient words to explain how I feel about this image - wonderful will have to do.</td>', 'Yowza!! Wonderful image - the white are right on the edge, the star effect is a very deft touch and the colored arch shadows are - unbelivable.  I completely understand your reluctance to put a font on the image - it wouldn''t do a thing for the image at all.  This would also be a great Chamber of Commerce image - might want to see if you can seel it to them. :>) I don''t have sufficient words to explain how I feel about this image - wonderful will have to do.', '2009-04-06 23:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5423002, 779497, 101256, '<td valign="top">Perfect - simply perfect from the colors, the theme, the subject and the font and font color.  The Melbourne fade effect is incredible - a pro quality shot. Extremely effective, dramatic and purposeful. Well done.</td>', 'Perfect - simply perfect from the colors, the theme, the subject and the font and font color.  The Melbourne fade effect is incredible - a pro quality shot. Extremely effective, dramatic and purposeful. Well done.', '2009-04-06 23:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5423003, 779508, 101256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image with subtle tones - the whites are a little overdone and a little distracting, but they don''t significantly impact the image in a negative fashion. The font is perfect and font color exactly matches the theme of the image. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful image with subtle tones - the whites are a little overdone and a little distracting, but they don''t significantly impact the image in a negative fashion. The font is perfect and font color exactly matches the theme of the image. Well done.', '2009-04-06 23:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5423004, 779052, 101256, '<td valign="top">Almost perfect. It''s over sharpened (halos around the rocks and mermaid), it jumps out at you. However, when printed you wouldn''t be able to tell, so I won''t mark it down for that. The overall impact of this image is stellar and would be a sure fire favorite at a tourist shop.  The drop shadow font is perfect and handled very well - very precise and purposeful. Overall color and tone plus the dramatic sky make this an outstanding entry.</td>', 'Almost perfect. It''s over sharpened (halos around the rocks and mermaid), it jumps out at you. However, when printed you wouldn''t be able to tell, so I won''t mark it down for that. The overall impact of this image is stellar and would be a sure fire favorite at a tourist shop.  The drop shadow font is perfect and handled very well - very precise and purposeful. Overall color and tone plus the dramatic sky make this an outstanding entry.', '2009-04-06 23:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5423005, 779283, 101256, '<td valign="top">Really nice image - excellant composition with the slight angle of the beach - the lonely subject walking the beach is very iconic of Cape Cod and being a surf fisherman who has been at this exact spot, it''s perfectly. It works as a post card in a lot of ways. The two fonts selected are very compatiable and the colors are fine. A very nice depiction of a national and regional treasure. Well done.</td>', 'Really nice image - excellant composition with the slight angle of the beach - the lonely subject walking the beach is very iconic of Cape Cod and being a surf fisherman who has been at this exact spot, it''s perfectly. It works as a post card in a lot of ways. The two fonts selected are very compatiable and the colors are fine. A very nice depiction of a national and regional treasure. Well done.', '2009-04-06 23:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5423007, 779149, 101256, '<td valign="top">Perfect - iconic imagery, colorful, lights right on the edge and the sky and buildings are complimentary. The transparent frame works on this and the font and font colors are appropaite both for the picture and for the city itself. Great capture and processing.</td>', 'Perfect - iconic imagery, colorful, lights right on the edge and the sky and buildings are complimentary. The transparent frame works on this and the font and font colors are appropaite both for the picture and for the city itself. Great capture and processing.', '2009-04-06 23:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5423008, 779416, 101256, '<td valign="top">Technically excellant with one little white bloom near the center bridge support - good impact on the eye - very pleasing conversion using the light properly to create the ambience. You left a period out of the NYC. I''m not terribly happy about the font mix, but I''m a font Nazi. :&gt;) I might have left out the NYC and just gone with Gotham - everybody knows where Gotham is. Well done.</td>', 'Technically excellant with one little white bloom near the center bridge support - good impact on the eye - very pleasing conversion using the light properly to create the ambience. You left a period out of the NYC. I''m not terribly happy about the font mix, but I''m a font Nazi. :>) I might have left out the NYC and just gone with Gotham - everybody knows where Gotham is. Well done.', '2009-04-06 23:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5423023, 779721, 101256, '<td valign="top">The colors are bland and there is a little too much water to be an effective treatment of Central Park. The font is fine, but the color clashes with the overall tone of the city. The little spots on the water don''t add to the image at all.</td>', 'The colors are bland and there is a little too much water to be an effective treatment of Central Park. The font is fine, but the color clashes with the overall tone of the city. The little spots on the water don''t add to the image at all.', '2009-04-06 23:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5423037, 779167, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful image with one little flaw - the light tower windows looks like streaks and are not defined.  Those who are familiar with the light would know what the streaks are, but those who are could count this as an image defect. It might have worked to clone them out or maybe adjust the exposure to add some measure of definition to the windows. Otherwise, it''s a wonderful image - very smooth and even tones from white through black. Effective use of lighting. Very well done.</td>', 'This is a wonderful image with one little flaw - the light tower windows looks like streaks and are not defined.  Those who are familiar with the light would know what the streaks are, but those who are could count this as an image defect. It might have worked to clone them out or maybe adjust the exposure to add some measure of definition to the windows. Otherwise, it''s a wonderful image - very smooth and even tones from white through black. Effective use of lighting. Very well done.', '2009-04-06 23:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5423043, 779138, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good effective representation of the area. Very subtle use of font to fill in some dead space in the image. It seems that the focus is a little soft, but not terribly noticable. A good overall effort.</td>', 'A good effective representation of the area. Very subtle use of font to fill in some dead space in the image. It seems that the focus is a little soft, but not terribly noticable. A good overall effort.', '2009-04-06 23:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5423045, 779786, 70484, '<td valign="top">Great cityscape! Never would have guessed it was Cleveland :-) 10</td>', 'Great cityscape! Never would have guessed it was Cleveland :-) 10', '2009-04-06 23:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5423100, 779596, 811, '<td valign="top">very nice indeed.</td>', 'very nice indeed.', '2009-04-06 23:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
