(5423404, 779627, 42013, '<td valign="top">I love these little guys... This would make a great postcard.</td>', 'I love these little guys... This would make a great postcard.', '2009-04-07 03:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5423426, 779460, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice reflections/colors in the water.  The skyline buildings are illuminated nicely.  However, the skyline/buildings get lost in the black sky, which doesn''t make it standout for me.  I''m guessing the image was taken well after sunset, I wonder how it would compare if the photo was taken in the "blue hour" right after the sun goes down but the sky isn''t totally dark.  I''m thinking the building lights would be on by then but you would capture the buildings against a lighter/blue sky and the buildings wouldn''t blend into the sky.  Just my very amateur humble opinion...</td>', 'Nice reflections/colors in the water.  The skyline buildings are illuminated nicely.  However, the skyline/buildings get lost in the black sky, which doesn''t make it standout for me.  I''m guessing the image was taken well after sunset, I wonder how it would compare if the photo was taken in the "blue hour" right after the sun goes down but the sky isn''t totally dark.  I''m thinking the building lights would be on by then but you would capture the buildings against a lighter/blue sky and the buildings wouldn''t blend into the sky.  Just my very amateur humble opinion...', '2009-04-07 04:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5423433, 779801, 103032, '<td valign="top">I''m not getting it.  Its a small picture of a leaf... and that''s a postcard of Cleveland?</td>', 'I''m not getting it.  Its a small picture of a leaf... and that''s a postcard of Cleveland?', '2009-04-07 04:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5423435, 779649, 103032, '<td valign="top">Seems more like a Coca Cola ad page than a postcard...</td>', 'Seems more like a Coca Cola ad page than a postcard...', '2009-04-07 04:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5423436, 779469, 103032, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t strike me as a postcard, more like a birthday card.  Sorry, doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Doesn''t strike me as a postcard, more like a birthday card.  Sorry, doesn''t work for me.', '2009-04-07 04:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5423443, 777965, 103032, '<td valign="top">It seems obvious that the main postcard subject is the Hollywood sign.  However, the Hollywood sign is such a small part of this image.  The composition doesn''t work.  The red flowers on the tree dominate.  The center of the image makes you focus on the radio tower.  I think the sign needs to dominate, probably look for a different angle where you can compose the Hollywood sign with the hill and be able cut out the radio tower for sure.  Maybe try a vertical shot with the sign toward the upper third and lower third with the homes/studios below to convey that ordinary folks are looking up and "dreaming" of being Hollywood stars....  Maybe look for an angle maybe miles toward your left.  Its looks like from the overlap of the letters that you are way to the right of center of the sign.  So my critique would be try a different angle and try a vertical shot.</td>', 'It seems obvious that the main postcard subject is the Hollywood sign.  However, the Hollywood sign is such a small part of this image.  The composition doesn''t work.  The red flowers on the tree dominate.  The center of the image makes you focus on the radio tower.  I think the sign needs to dominate, probably look for a different angle where you can compose the Hollywood sign with the hill and be able cut out the radio tower for sure.  Maybe try a vertical shot with the sign toward the upper third and lower third with the homes/studios below to convey that ordinary folks are looking up and "dreaming" of being Hollywood stars....  Maybe look for an angle maybe miles toward your left.  Its looks like from the overlap of the letters that you are way to the right of center of the sign.  So my critique would be try a different angle and try a vertical shot.', '2009-04-07 04:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5423445, 779586, 103032, '<td valign="top">This one is throwing me off.  The bottom half looks like it was taken during the day and the upper half at night.  A little bit too "warm"/yellow for me.  Maybe too much contrast or saturation?</td>', 'This one is throwing me off.  The bottom half looks like it was taken during the day and the upper half at night.  A little bit too "warm"/yellow for me.  Maybe too much contrast or saturation?', '2009-04-07 04:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5423482, 779586, 86799, '<td valign="top">The dark sky vignetting over into the roof lines gives this a foreboding look.  Not sure if that''s what you were after.</td>', 'The dark sky vignetting over into the roof lines gives this a foreboding look.  Not sure if that''s what you were after.', '2009-04-07 06:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5423483, 779817, 86799, '<td valign="top">The object and its position are more of a mystery than an invitation.  The sky and text are great.</td>', 'The object and its position are more of a mystery than an invitation.  The sky and text are great.', '2009-04-07 06:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5423484, 779732, 86799, '<td valign="top">Really good postcard feel.  Nice work.</td>', 'Really good postcard feel.  Nice work.', '2009-04-07 06:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5423486, 778836, 86799, '<td valign="top">Didn''t know there was such a place.  After seeing this postcard, I''ll have to check it out next time I''m in town.  Show this to Insect World, bet they''d buy it.</td>', 'Didn''t know there was such a place.  After seeing this postcard, I''ll have to check it out next time I''m in town.  Show this to Insect World, bet they''d buy it.', '2009-04-07 06:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5423487, 779725, 86799, '<td valign="top">Needs some interest, some draw.</td>', 'Needs some interest, some draw.', '2009-04-07 06:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
