(5423498, 779463, 57229, '<td valign="top">Right on. It even looks like it was taken in 1973 :) There''s postcard <strike>pints</strike> points for that.</td>', 'Right on. It even looks like it was taken in 1973 :) There''s postcard pints points for that.', '2009-04-07 07:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
