(5429111, 779175, 83313, '<td valign="top">Pleasing treatment, and I like the green color of the scooter. What did you use do do it? Topaz or Photomatix? I''m not sure how this represents Memphis, or would encourage me to visit it. Something relating to the feathers or the radio station sticker, perhaps?</td>', 'Pleasing treatment, and I like the green color of the scooter. What did you use do do it? Topaz or Photomatix? I''m not sure how this represents Memphis, or would encourage me to visit it. Something relating to the feathers or the radio station sticker, perhaps?', '2009-04-09 12:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429211, 779790, 79720, '<td valign="top">Not voting, only commenting:<br/> <br/>Very nicely exposed, although your horizon could use come straightening, and the dark area bottom left detracts a bit.</td>', 'Not voting, only commenting: Very nicely exposed, although your horizon could use come straightening, and the dark area bottom left detracts a bit.', '2009-04-09 12:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429220, 779102, 79720, '<td valign="top">Not voting, only commenting:<br/> <br/>Good framing, lovely location. I like the moment captured with the horse-drawn carriage.</td>', 'Not voting, only commenting: Good framing, lovely location. I like the moment captured with the horse-drawn carriage.', '2009-04-09 12:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429231, 779566, 79720, '<td valign="top">Not voting, only commenting:<br/> <br/>Love the light-on-white, very difficult to achieve.</td>', 'Not voting, only commenting: Love the light-on-white, very difficult to achieve.', '2009-04-09 12:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5429235, 779800, 79720, '<td valign="top">Not voting, only commenting:<br/> <br/>Wonderful location, nicely captured and post-processed. Terrible font choice! :-)</td>', 'Not voting, only commenting: Wonderful location, nicely captured and post-processed. Terrible font choice! :-)', '2009-04-09 12:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
