(5430629, 779719, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''ve never been to Cananda, but I can recognize Toronto from seeing it on DPC so much! Of course, it''s a great view, and that''s why it''s used so much. So what is it, like 40% of DPC members live in Toronto?</td>', 'I''ve never been to Cananda, but I can recognize Toronto from seeing it on DPC so much! Of course, it''s a great view, and that''s why it''s used so much. So what is it, like 40% of DPC members live in Toronto?', '2009-04-10 13:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5430634, 779157, 93407, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.</td>', 'Gorgeous.', '2009-04-10 13:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5430636, 779721, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, but tons of JPEG compression is taking away detail. Artifacts are visible in the sky around the text, but I think the compression is also taking some detail away from the buildings. At a 93k file size, you still had lots of overhead to use less compression.</td>', 'Nice scene, but tons of JPEG compression is taking away detail. Artifacts are visible in the sky around the text, but I think the compression is also taking some detail away from the buildings. At a 93k file size, you still had lots of overhead to use less compression.', '2009-04-10 13:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5430637, 779524, 93407, '<td valign="top">The font''s a little distracting for me.  Pretty shot though.</td>', 'The font''s a little distracting for me.  Pretty shot though.', '2009-04-10 13:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5430638, 779790, 93407, '<td valign="top">The square crop makes it not a classic post card, to my mind, but the photo is great.</td>', 'The square crop makes it not a classic post card, to my mind, but the photo is great.', '2009-04-10 13:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
