(5430640, 779605, 83313, '<td valign="top">What are these people doing? Reading a book and text messaging when they have such gorgeous scenery? Must be locals. Now if they were smooching in this romantic location, that would have really made the scene! Of course, it would have been rude of you to ask them to do that for your pic. I''m not being realistic about that.<br/> <br/>One nitpick. I think a little more sharpening would have helped this pop a bit more.</td>', 'What are these people doing? Reading a book and text messaging when they have such gorgeous scenery? Must be locals. Now if they were smooching in this romantic location, that would have really made the scene! Of course, it would have been rude of you to ask them to do that for your pic. I''m not being realistic about that. One nitpick. I think a little more sharpening would have helped this pop a bit more.', '2009-04-10 13:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5430643, 779766, 83313, '<td valign="top">Maybe needs something done to help it pop a little more. Good angle on the subject, though. I like strong perspectives.</td>', 'Maybe needs something done to help it pop a little more. Good angle on the subject, though. I like strong perspectives.', '2009-04-10 13:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
