(5430715, 779674, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this comes off to me as a snapshot, and I think any text added if it were a real postcard might be lost in the busy background. Those silver poled are interesting. I assume they are a form of a handrail?</td>', 'I''m afraid this comes off to me as a snapshot, and I think any text added if it were a real postcard might be lost in the busy background. Those silver poled are interesting. I assume they are a form of a handrail?', '2009-04-10 14:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5430725, 779167, 83313, '<td valign="top">A nice strong and smooth image. My only nitpick in there appears to be a slight tilt. <strike>That may just be a false perception on my own part.</strike> Popped it into my editor to check it, and it does indeed have a tilt to it.</td>', 'A nice strong and smooth image. My only nitpick in there appears to be a slight tilt. That may just be a false perception on my own part. Popped it into my editor to check it, and it does indeed have a tilt to it.', '2009-04-10 14:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
