(5430905, 779497, 79057, '<td valign="top">Cool shot ... would definately purchase this one!</td>', 'Cool shot ... would definately purchase this one!', '2009-04-10 16:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431011, 779635, 71893, '<td valign="top">I like bluish cast</td>', 'I like bluish cast', '2009-04-10 18:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431173, 779038, 101117, '<td valign="top">Funny, I looked at the thumbnail of this and thought, looks like the Australian outback, then I clicked on it and saw the text. Guess that means you captured the feel perfectly!</td>', 'Funny, I looked at the thumbnail of this and thought, looks like the Australian outback, then I clicked on it and saw the text. Guess that means you captured the feel perfectly!', '2009-04-10 20:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431175, 779825, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great detail in this shot, but for a postcard it feels a bit too tight.  If I was looking for a beach postcard I would be looking for long empty expanses and blue skies /  blue water.</td>', 'Great detail in this shot, but for a postcard it feels a bit too tight.  If I was looking for a beach postcard I would be looking for long empty expanses and blue skies /  blue water.', '2009-04-10 20:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431176, 779726, 101117, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot with great detail, not so sure about postcard material though, I think it might put some people off going to the place!</td>', 'Wonderful shot with great detail, not so sure about postcard material though, I think it might put some people off going to the place!', '2009-04-10 20:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431179, 779138, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is exactly the kind of thing I would be looking for on a postcard, empty expanses of sand, blue skies! This one feels a bit cold for me though, might be the colour cast you have, but when I look at this I feel like I would be walking on the beach with a jacket on!</td>', 'This is exactly the kind of thing I would be looking for on a postcard, empty expanses of sand, blue skies! This one feels a bit cold for me though, might be the colour cast you have, but when I look at this I feel like I would be walking on the beach with a jacket on!', '2009-04-10 20:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431181, 779774, 101117, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing what you''re going for here is a baseball card rather than a tourist postcard, from that point of view it''s cute, but I''m not sure about the mass appeal factor.</td>', 'I''m guessing what you''re going for here is a baseball card rather than a tourist postcard, from that point of view it''s cute, but I''m not sure about the mass appeal factor.', '2009-04-10 20:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431183, 779156, 101117, '<td valign="top">Not keen on the framing here, the big rock in the lower right is taking up about a quarter of the space of the entire image. Also, I don''t get the logo on the top left but I''m guessing it has some sort of local significance to the place.</td>', 'Not keen on the framing here, the big rock in the lower right is taking up about a quarter of the space of the entire image. Also, I don''t get the logo on the top left but I''m guessing it has some sort of local significance to the place.', '2009-04-10 20:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431185, 779806, 101117, '<td valign="top">The glow you have from the setting / rising sun is very nice, but you have left the rest of the shot looking a bit dark and lifeless. You should also have got rid of the 2 sensor dust spots!</td>', 'The glow you have from the setting / rising sun is very nice, but you have left the rest of the shot looking a bit dark and lifeless. You should also have got rid of the 2 sensor dust spots!', '2009-04-10 20:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431187, 779800, 101117, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the B&amp;W / sepia tone on this one, and I think for postcards in general colourful is better.<br/> <br/>The shot itself lacks anything substantial, which again could be down to the sepia making the water blend in with the other foreground objects.</td>', 'I don''t like the B&W / sepia tone on this one, and I think for postcards in general colourful is better. The shot itself lacks anything substantial, which again could be down to the sepia making the water blend in with the other foreground objects.', '2009-04-10 20:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431190, 778354, 101117, '<td valign="top">Interesting enough subject, but I think the weather has let you down somewhat and left the shot looking a little dull and lifeless.</td>', 'Interesting enough subject, but I think the weather has let you down somewhat and left the shot looking a little dull and lifeless.', '2009-04-10 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431192, 779472, 101117, '<td valign="top">This captures Amsterdam exactly as I remember it! Those very distinctive buildings running down either side of the waterways. Shame about the overcast sky, but not much you could do about that!</td>', 'This captures Amsterdam exactly as I remember it! Those very distinctive buildings running down either side of the waterways. Shame about the overcast sky, but not much you could do about that!', '2009-04-10 20:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431193, 779109, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very nice postcard like shot. I''ve seen a few so far where the clouds let the shot down, but I think the clouds in yours work very well. The trees in the foreground nicely frame the monument as well.</td>', 'Very nice postcard like shot. I''ve seen a few so far where the clouds let the shot down, but I think the clouds in yours work very well. The trees in the foreground nicely frame the monument as well.', '2009-04-10 20:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431199, 779497, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great view of Melbourne and some nice vivid colours. I would like to see more of the left bank as this shot leaves me feeling like I''m missing out on something of interest there and feels a little off centre as well.</td>', 'Great view of Melbourne and some nice vivid colours. I would like to see more of the left bank as this shot leaves me feeling like I''m missing out on something of interest there and feels a little off centre as well.', '2009-04-10 20:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431201, 779283, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very nice, the guy really makes this one. I think you have gone over the top with the text along the top though, and I don''t like the use of the two different fonts and colours for the text. I would have preferred it if the top text wasn''t there at all. Still, 7 from me, would have been 8 but for the text thing.</td>', 'Very nice, the guy really makes this one. I think you have gone over the top with the text along the top though, and I don''t like the use of the two different fonts and colours for the text. I would have preferred it if the top text wasn''t there at all. Still, 7 from me, would have been 8 but for the text thing.', '2009-04-10 20:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431204, 779749, 101117, '<td valign="top">"I''ve been everywhere man...", though admittedly not to Possum Trot!<br/> <br/>Don''t like the green border, apart from that, really interesting shot, just the kind of thing I would buy as a novelty postcard!</td>', '"I''ve been everywhere man...", though admittedly not to Possum Trot! Don''t like the green border, apart from that, really interesting shot, just the kind of thing I would buy as a novelty postcard!', '2009-04-10 20:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431205, 779719, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great skyline shot and really good colours. Not a fan of the large borders though, think it would have been better without them, or at least if they weren''t taking so much of the frame.</td>', 'Great skyline shot and really good colours. Not a fan of the large borders though, think it would have been better without them, or at least if they weren''t taking so much of the frame.', '2009-04-10 20:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431209, 779614, 101117, '<td valign="top">Not sure about it''s postcard quality but you have a potentially interesting subject here but the crop is way too tight, I would have liked to have seen the whole vehicle.</td>', 'Not sure about it''s postcard quality but you have a potentially interesting subject here but the crop is way too tight, I would have liked to have seen the whole vehicle.', '2009-04-10 20:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431215, 779351, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot, but if I was a tourist buying a postcard of St. Paul''s I would definitely want to see the most prominent feature, the large dome roof!<br/> <br/>Nice colouring, the B&amp;W allows for the detail to really come through and I like the black sky leaving all the attention on the building.</td>', 'This is a very nice shot, but if I was a tourist buying a postcard of St. Paul''s I would definitely want to see the most prominent feature, the large dome roof! Nice colouring, the B&W allows for the detail to really come through and I like the black sky leaving all the attention on the building.', '2009-04-10 21:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431220, 779671, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait shot, but definitely doesn''t have postcard type appeal.<br/> <br/>As a portrait I think you''ve done a great job here, the focus is great, and I think you have the DOF just right. The lighting, especially the darker background is well done.<br/> <br/>I am however only giving this a 5, and that''s because I''m basing my voting for this challenge on how likely I would be to buy this as a postcard. It would be lower if it wasn''t such a great shot otherwise.</td>', 'This is a great portrait shot, but definitely doesn''t have postcard type appeal. As a portrait I think you''ve done a great job here, the focus is great, and I think you have the DOF just right. The lighting, especially the darker background is well done. I am however only giving this a 5, and that''s because I''m basing my voting for this challenge on how likely I would be to buy this as a postcard. It would be lower if it wasn''t such a great shot otherwise.', '2009-04-10 21:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431221, 779807, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great postcard style shot. Good exposure, lighting and colours. Looks like you have cropped a little of it out though judging by the aspect ratio, and I think it would have been better to get the whole fountain in the frame since that is your subject.</td>', 'Great postcard style shot. Good exposure, lighting and colours. Looks like you have cropped a little of it out though judging by the aspect ratio, and I think it would have been better to get the whole fountain in the frame since that is your subject.', '2009-04-10 21:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431223, 779787, 101117, '<td valign="top">I quite like this, with the boy face to face with the wolf, but I don''t know if this is the best angle. I would have liked to have seen the wolf more face on than top down.</td>', 'I quite like this, with the boy face to face with the wolf, but I don''t know if this is the best angle. I would have liked to have seen the wolf more face on than top down.', '2009-04-10 21:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431225, 779226, 101117, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, would work well for a zoo postcard. Looks like you have burned the left hand side just a touch too much though, but apart from that nicely done!</td>', 'Cute shot, would work well for a zoo postcard. Looks like you have burned the left hand side just a touch too much though, but apart from that nicely done!', '2009-04-10 21:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431228, 779508, 101117, '<td valign="top">Funny, I was thinking of doing this very shot for this challenge, but it rained the whole week so I never bothered entering in the end! <br/> <br/>You''ve done a good job here, especially given the weather you had to contend with. The whole thing has a nice gold tint to it, not sure if that''s something you added or whether it was a result of the clouds and the city lights but it works.<br/> <br/>It''s a shame part of the bridge isn''t lit, not much you could do about that though.</td>', 'Funny, I was thinking of doing this very shot for this challenge, but it rained the whole week so I never bothered entering in the end!  You''ve done a good job here, especially given the weather you had to contend with. The whole thing has a nice gold tint to it, not sure if that''s something you added or whether it was a result of the clouds and the city lights but it works. It''s a shame part of the bridge isn''t lit, not much you could do about that though.', '2009-04-10 21:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431231, 779594, 101117, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more of the background boats in this shot. What you have already is nice, especially the colour and texture of the water, but it feels a little cropped on the top.</td>', 'I would like to see more of the background boats in this shot. What you have already is nice, especially the colour and texture of the water, but it feels a little cropped on the top.', '2009-04-10 21:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431237, 779586, 101117, '<td valign="top">Love the colours and old feel of this one. Would have been nice to see more, but then  you would probably have lost some of the intricate detail you''ve managed to capture in this one.<br/> <br/>There is something just a little off about it though, I''m not entirely sure what it is, possibly from post processing. I can see some colour fringing on certain objects like the black drain pipe on the far left, and I''m not being super picky and saying that shouldn''t be on that particular drainpipe, but I feel that same effect runs right through the whole shot and gives it a slightly distorted look.</td>', 'Love the colours and old feel of this one. Would have been nice to see more, but then  you would probably have lost some of the intricate detail you''ve managed to capture in this one. There is something just a little off about it though, I''m not entirely sure what it is, possibly from post processing. I can see some colour fringing on certain objects like the black drain pipe on the far left, and I''m not being super picky and saying that shouldn''t be on that particular drainpipe, but I feel that same effect runs right through the whole shot and gives it a slightly distorted look.', '2009-04-10 21:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431244, 779823, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great shot, this is one of my favourites so far. I think the boats and the palm trees make this one. The text is also nicely done, and fits the shot well.</td>', 'Great shot, this is one of my favourites so far. I think the boats and the palm trees make this one. The text is also nicely done, and fits the shot well.', '2009-04-10 21:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431250, 779769, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but you''ve gone way over the top with the text. The text you have at the top while being a clever effect, makes the whole scene look small, and part of the wonder of the falls is their sheer size.</td>', 'Great shot, but you''ve gone way over the top with the text. The text you have at the top while being a clever effect, makes the whole scene look small, and part of the wonder of the falls is their sheer size.', '2009-04-10 21:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431258, 779730, 79357, '<td valign="top">Your text "Wish you were here"... haha<br/>...on the cemetery...</td>', 'Your text "Wish you were here"... haha...on the cemetery...', '2009-04-10 21:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431268, 779137, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great shot, love the silhouette amidst all the flowers! My only problem is I don''t actually know where it is!</td>', 'Great shot, love the silhouette amidst all the flowers! My only problem is I don''t actually know where it is!', '2009-04-10 22:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431270, 779327, 101117, '<td valign="top">The contrast between the sparkling white snow and the trees is good. I like the way you have captured the bird taking flight, but I would have preferred to see it more to the right of the frame to give it space to "fly into".</td>', 'The contrast between the sparkling white snow and the trees is good. I like the way you have captured the bird taking flight, but I would have preferred to see it more to the right of the frame to give it space to "fly into".', '2009-04-10 22:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431271, 779786, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice clean crisp shot. The colours area great and everything is sharp and clear.<br/> <br/>I like the way you have placed subtle text into the dark area of the shot keeping it out of the way of the actual postcard. 9 from me.</td>', 'This is a very nice clean crisp shot. The colours area great and everything is sharp and clear. I like the way you have placed subtle text into the dark area of the shot keeping it out of the way of the actual postcard. 9 from me.', '2009-04-10 22:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431274, 779732, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice view of the city. I would have liked to see all of the bridges on the left and right of the shot.</td>', 'Nice view of the city. I would have liked to see all of the bridges on the left and right of the shot.', '2009-04-10 22:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431276, 779632, 101117, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but there''s a weird texture thing going on here like you''ve scanned this from an old book or something.<br/> <br/>I think a wider shot would have helped, what you can see is interesting enough but I would like to see more.</td>', 'Interesting shot, but there''s a weird texture thing going on here like you''ve scanned this from an old book or something. I think a wider shot would have helped, what you can see is interesting enough but I would like to see more.', '2009-04-10 22:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431278, 779224, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great view of the Houses Of Parliament. Feels like you have cropped it just a little tightly on the left hand side though and I''m not a fan of the large black borders on the top and bottom of the shot.</td>', 'Great view of the Houses Of Parliament. Feels like you have cropped it just a little tightly on the left hand side though and I''m not a fan of the large black borders on the top and bottom of the shot.', '2009-04-10 22:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431279, 779627, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a great old fashioned looking postcard shot, reminds me of the kind of things I used to see at Blackpool when I was young!</td>', 'This is a great old fashioned looking postcard shot, reminds me of the kind of things I used to see at Blackpool when I was young!', '2009-04-10 22:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431280, 779416, 101117, '<td valign="top">Wonderful moody shot! Great B&amp;W tones. Love the way the bridge seems to stretch off to infinity.</td>', 'Wonderful moody shot! Great B&W tones. Love the way the bridge seems to stretch off to infinity.', '2009-04-10 22:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431282, 779463, 101117, '<td valign="top">Yep, just what you would expect on a postcard of Sydney!<br/> <br/> I was going to go out and do a shot of the Opera house as well, but it rained all bloody week so in the end I never bothered entering anything. I see from the sky you faced the same problem :)</td>', 'Yep, just what you would expect on a postcard of Sydney!  I was going to go out and do a shot of the Opera house as well, but it rained all bloody week so in the end I never bothered entering anything. I see from the sky you faced the same problem :)', '2009-04-10 22:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431283, 779816, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great shot, never been there but I imagine you had a pretty hard time getting this with no people!<br/> <br/>There seems to be a bit of a halo around the buildings, especially around the dome roof.</td>', 'Great shot, never been there but I imagine you had a pretty hard time getting this with no people! There seems to be a bit of a halo around the buildings, especially around the dome roof.', '2009-04-10 22:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431286, 779484, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, though I would have liked to have been able to see a bit more detail, perhaps a bit more exposure would have helped. I don''t think the text really fits well with the placid sombre mood of the photo.</td>', 'Nice shot, though I would have liked to have been able to see a bit more detail, perhaps a bit more exposure would have helped. I don''t think the text really fits well with the placid sombre mood of the photo.', '2009-04-10 22:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431287, 779736, 101117, '<td valign="top">I know I''m probably going to be the 200th person to say this, but "The Moo"?</td>', 'I know I''m probably going to be the 200th person to say this, but "The Moo"?', '2009-04-10 22:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431290, 779715, 101117, '<td valign="top">Way too dark, there''s enough detail there so I think you could have lightened this up. Other than that it''s a pretty nice shot.</td>', 'Way too dark, there''s enough detail there so I think you could have lightened this up. Other than that it''s a pretty nice shot.', '2009-04-10 22:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431294, 779600, 101117, '<td valign="top">I imagine these buildings are very colourful and I''m not sure why you would choose to change it to a B&amp;W shot. <br/> <br/>If you had kept colour you would have the contrast of the whites and yellows of the buildings against the blue of the sky, which I believe would have looked a lot nicer. As it is, with the B&amp;W it just looks quite flat and uninteresting.</td>', 'I imagine these buildings are very colourful and I''m not sure why you would choose to change it to a B&W shot.  If you had kept colour you would have the contrast of the whites and yellows of the buildings against the blue of the sky, which I believe would have looked a lot nicer. As it is, with the B&W it just looks quite flat and uninteresting.', '2009-04-10 22:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431297, 779359, 101117, '<td valign="top">Where? Nice shot, but you have given absolutely no indication of where it is, which is something I think a postcard is intended to do.</td>', 'Where? Nice shot, but you have given absolutely no indication of where it is, which is something I think a postcard is intended to do.', '2009-04-10 22:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
