(5431457, 779149, 30454, '<td valign="top">Excellent image. Would like to know from where to get this view. One of my top score, good luck.</td>', 'Excellent image. Would like to know from where to get this view. One of my top score, good luck.', '2009-04-11 00:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431458, 779529, 30454, '<td valign="top">Excellent tones, great image and good title to go with it. One of my high score, good luck.</td>', 'Excellent tones, great image and good title to go with it. One of my high score, good luck.', '2009-04-11 00:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431676, 779576, 70484, '<td valign="top">Already voted, coming back to comment now. I love this postcard and picture. My only suggestion would be that the yellow letters in the words are very hard to read. It might have been better if you could have changed those to orange so they could be seen better. I love the playfulness though and the boarder is great. 9</td>', 'Already voted, coming back to comment now. I love this postcard and picture. My only suggestion would be that the yellow letters in the words are very hard to read. It might have been better if you could have changed those to orange so they could be seen better. I love the playfulness though and the boarder is great. 9', '2009-04-11 04:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431766, 779508, 24073, '<td valign="top">Well I think I''ve got my scores finalized, and this one made it into my top spot.  I love the warm colors you brought forth, and the text is simple, and very postcardish &lt;---prolly not a word, but you get it.  Very nice, good luck.</td>', 'Well I think I''ve got my scores finalized, and this one made it into my top spot.  I love the warm colors you brought forth, and the text is simple, and very postcardish <---prolly not a word, but you get it.  Very nice, good luck.', '2009-04-11 08:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431769, 779416, 24073, '<td valign="top">Well when its said and done this one made my top 5.  I like how you drew out a very serine yet sophisticated look to your entry.  I simple, its interesting, and its beautiful.<br/> <br/>If I had one complaint, or critique it''d be I don''t like the NYC text.  The rest of the text seemed very discipined, and well put, but the NYC not so much.</td>', 'Well when its said and done this one made my top 5.  I like how you drew out a very serine yet sophisticated look to your entry.  I simple, its interesting, and its beautiful. If I had one complaint, or critique it''d be I don''t like the NYC text.  The rest of the text seemed very discipined, and well put, but the NYC not so much.', '2009-04-11 08:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431770, 779769, 24073, '<td valign="top">Great use of the text to your entry.  Disciplined, and to the point.  As for the photo,  you did a great job.  No overblown colors or lights, very smooth sharp look, and not alot of noise.  I gotcha in my top 5, good luck.</td>', 'Great use of the text to your entry.  Disciplined, and to the point.  As for the photo,  you did a great job.  No overblown colors or lights, very smooth sharp look, and not alot of noise.  I gotcha in my top 5, good luck.', '2009-04-11 08:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431773, 779823, 24073, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how this made it into my top 5.  I just kept a look at it, and it grew on me steadily.  I really think it says MIAMI, and the colors are fabulous.  There is some blown out whites, and I''m not crazy over the text, you can obviously see there was some wind in the trees and shrubbery that hindered the photo a bit, but I never subtracted for it, because I personally like the setting it sets.  I really dig the balance of the composition, the way the buildings end, and the trees fill in the space. <br/>great job, good luck. 9.</td>', 'I''m not sure how this made it into my top 5.  I just kept a look at it, and it grew on me steadily.  I really think it says MIAMI, and the colors are fabulous.  There is some blown out whites, and I''m not crazy over the text, you can obviously see there was some wind in the trees and shrubbery that hindered the photo a bit, but I never subtracted for it, because I personally like the setting it sets.  I really dig the balance of the composition, the way the buildings end, and the trees fill in the space. great job, good luck. 9.', '2009-04-11 08:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431776, 779808, 24073, '<td valign="top">This is a good fresh idea you brought to the postcard challenge, and I appreciate that.  Colors great, sharpness good, composition is really nice.  The text...ah..so, so.  The format feels a bit square for a postcard, but I didn''t take away any score for that.  I think you did a great job, and if it were up to me you definately land a top 10, but its not, so good luck.</td>', 'This is a good fresh idea you brought to the postcard challenge, and I appreciate that.  Colors great, sharpness good, composition is really nice.  The text...ah..so, so.  The format feels a bit square for a postcard, but I didn''t take away any score for that.  I think you did a great job, and if it were up to me you definately land a top 10, but its not, so good luck.', '2009-04-11 08:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431779, 779197, 24073, '<td valign="top">I have this one at the top of my scores, but if I were to critique it I''d say its a little boring.  Lots of downtown shots to choose from, and this one really only says miami is a big city.  Not the typical, palm trees, ocean, and hot pinks, and purples exposing night life.  At the same time I scored it high enough for top 25.  Good luck.</td>', 'I have this one at the top of my scores, but if I were to critique it I''d say its a little boring.  Lots of downtown shots to choose from, and this one really only says miami is a big city.  Not the typical, palm trees, ocean, and hot pinks, and purples exposing night life.  At the same time I scored it high enough for top 25.  Good luck.', '2009-04-11 09:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431781, 778354, 24073, '<td valign="top">This is good, of course you have quite a few bridge shots to compete with.  I only have one ahead of ya.  I like colors, the green on the dark sky is wonderful.  On my end, and I should say I''m not sure my computer is calibrated right, but I can see some obvious dodging blotches.  One set is in the green right behind the further away two support beams.  Then the closer two supports in the whitish grey areas.  Still a great shot.</td>', 'This is good, of course you have quite a few bridge shots to compete with.  I only have one ahead of ya.  I like colors, the green on the dark sky is wonderful.  On my end, and I should say I''m not sure my computer is calibrated right, but I can see some obvious dodging blotches.  One set is in the green right behind the further away two support beams.  Then the closer two supports in the whitish grey areas.  Still a great shot.', '2009-04-11 09:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431783, 778609, 24073, '<td valign="top">Well this is a fantastic postcard.  I love what you did with the photo standing out on the border.  The blue in the sky looks wonderful to back up the red rock.  I''m bumping up...again. 9.</td>', 'Well this is a fantastic postcard.  I love what you did with the photo standing out on the border.  The blue in the sky looks wonderful to back up the red rock.  I''m bumping up...again. 9.', '2009-04-11 09:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5431788, 779497, 24073, '<td valign="top">Ok, so you look like you''ve taken a couple photos in your time.  Absolutely great job.  The text, the composition, the colors, sharpness, and even the location all stand out to say I''m a solid top vote getter.  Great job.<br/> <br/>One critique, a standard postcard normally isn''t so square.  It probably would normally need a more 4x6 orientation.</td>', 'Ok, so you look like you''ve taken a couple photos in your time.  Absolutely great job.  The text, the composition, the colors, sharpness, and even the location all stand out to say I''m a solid top vote getter.  Great job. One critique, a standard postcard normally isn''t so square.  It probably would normally need a more 4x6 orientation.', '2009-04-11 09:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
