(5432434, 779814, 83313, '<td valign="top">I expect to see this in the top 10, if not a ribbon. My favorite part is the puckered texture of the water flowing around that rock in the bottom right. It''s a minor detail that makes the image for me.</td>', 'I expect to see this in the top 10, if not a ribbon. My favorite part is the puckered texture of the water flowing around that rock in the bottom right. It''s a minor detail that makes the image for me.', '2009-04-11 21:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
