(5433946, 779769, 23002, '<td valign="top">David, congrats on a top 10 in one of the highest scoring challenges I have ever seen on dpc!<br/> <br/>I do have to ask though..why the shot of the American falls and not ours?  I know it is easier to shoot......but then the text should read NF NY, not Ontario Canada?  <br/> <br/>I might be back up that way for a weekend in the next month or so.  If  I get up there I will let you know and we can go for a shoot.<br/> <br/>Once again, congrats!  Great image.</td>', 'David, congrats on a top 10 in one of the highest scoring challenges I have ever seen on dpc! I do have to ask though..why the shot of the American falls and not ours?  I know it is easier to shoot......but then the text should read NF NY, not Ontario Canada?   I might be back up that way for a weekend in the next month or so.  If  I get up there I will let you know and we can go for a shoot. Once again, congrats!  Great image.', '2009-04-13 01:20:13.000000', NULL, 0),
