(5434095, 779137, 69008, '<td valign="top">I like this, top and bottom.  The layering in the receding hills is sweet, as well as the lovely backlit flowers in the foreground.  The light is a little hot at the top right, but not enough to be a bad thing.  The cow is very cool too, and not expected in a post card.</td>', 'I like this, top and bottom.  The layering in the receding hills is sweet, as well as the lovely backlit flowers in the foreground.  The light is a little hot at the top right, but not enough to be a bad thing.  The cow is very cool too, and not expected in a post card.', '2009-04-13 01:42:57.000000', NULL, 0),
