(5434146, 779825, 69008, '<td valign="top">Seeing the orange light in the areas right behind the shells gives me the impression that there was a grand sunset or sunrise going on at about the time you shot this.  <br/>It''s a good postcard of the type seen in this area, and those are common shells at the beaches here.  The font looks sort of 60''s ish, which fits with the theme nicely too.</td>', 'Seeing the orange light in the areas right behind the shells gives me the impression that there was a grand sunset or sunrise going on at about the time you shot this.  It''s a good postcard of the type seen in this area, and those are common shells at the beaches here.  The font looks sort of 60''s ish, which fits with the theme nicely too.', '2009-04-13 02:03:54.000000', NULL, 0),
