(5434156, 779200, 79955, '<td valign="top">Congrats , this is brilliant with a great score !!!</td>', 'Congrats , this is brilliant with a great score !!!', '2009-04-13 02:09:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5434158, 779607, 69008, '<td valign="top">The very complex area of small limbs and branches sort of draw my eyes to them, looking as a photographer, for the technical quality and sharpness in that greatly detailed area.  It must be very hard to make places like this look great right at the end of winter. The pathway makes a very nice leading line in this shot. <br/>Too bad that they had to cut down the one tree that used to be in the lower left. I love trees.</td>', 'The very complex area of small limbs and branches sort of draw my eyes to them, looking as a photographer, for the technical quality and sharpness in that greatly detailed area.  It must be very hard to make places like this look great right at the end of winter. The pathway makes a very nice leading line in this shot. Too bad that they had to cut down the one tree that used to be in the lower left. I love trees.', '2009-04-13 02:10:46.000000', NULL, 0),
