(5434215, 779156, 69008, '<td valign="top">That spot by the Hy64 bridge is an amazing place, the way the flat land just has a huge long deep hole in it with the small looking river flowing along the bottom.  It was a rainy day when I was there too, in Oct 06.  I lost a bag with a couple of lenses in it there near the warm spring and had to use the images in my camera to backtrack and find them.</td>', 'That spot by the Hy64 bridge is an amazing place, the way the flat land just has a huge long deep hole in it with the small looking river flowing along the bottom.  It was a rainy day when I was there too, in Oct 06.  I lost a bag with a couple of lenses in it there near the warm spring and had to use the images in my camera to backtrack and find them.', '2009-04-13 02:42:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5434219, 779806, 98663, '<td valign="top">People didn''t like this for the very reason I did.... I love how the sun is right behind the picture.  Its a temple I feel like the sun is showing holiness around the temple.  Although I didn''t see the two specks in the top right hand corner its really snow not dust it was snowing while I was taking this picture.</td>', 'People didn''t like this for the very reason I did.... I love how the sun is right behind the picture.  Its a temple I feel like the sun is showing holiness around the temple.  Although I didn''t see the two specks in the top right hand corner its really snow not dust it was snowing while I was taking this picture.', '2009-04-13 02:44:05.000000', NULL, 0),
