(5434397, 779773, 19708, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bmilne:</b></div><hr/><i> nice capture, but could use a tune up in photoshop to make it pop just a bit more, especially in the eye </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Appreciated the comment and suggestion. I opted not to Post-process this more as I wanted it to truly look like it really was. A Lion''s eye, when closed is a light color lid showing and burned it in a bit, as it really looks weird, almost makes them look like they are blind.<br/> <br/>To all that left so many great compliments, thanks!<br/>Was a nice change of pace to score well.</td>', 'Originally posted by bmilne: nice capture, but could use a tune up in photoshop to make it pop just a bit more, especially in the eye   Appreciated the comment and suggestion. I opted not to Post-process this more as I wanted it to truly look like it really was. A Lion''s eye, when closed is a light color lid showing and burned it in a bit, as it really looks weird, almost makes them look like they are blind. To all that left so many great compliments, thanks!Was a nice change of pace to score well.', '2009-04-13 05:03:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5434400, 779416, 52549, '<td valign="top">Have to tell you again how much I love this image. It''s stunning and I''m so pleased it did well for you.</td>', 'Have to tell you again how much I love this image. It''s stunning and I''m so pleased it did well for you.', '2009-04-13 05:09:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5434402, 778116, 60173, '<td valign="top">In a way I sort of like the power lines. It''s historic England... with power! When I think of historic England I think of candles and button flap PJ''s. It''s nice to see that you guys have power there now, heh.</td>', 'In a way I sort of like the power lines. It''s historic England... with power! When I think of historic England I think of candles and button flap PJ''s. It''s nice to see that you guys have power there now, heh.', '2009-04-13 05:15:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5434403, 779052, 25355, '<td valign="top">I don''t think they get clouds like that in England. On the other hand, they don''t get mermaids like that, either.</td>', 'I don''t think they get clouds like that in England. On the other hand, they don''t get mermaids like that, either.', '2009-04-13 05:41:35.000000', NULL, 0),
