(5434596, 779156, 32837, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by DigiFotoBuddy:</b></div><hr/><i> Looks nice scene, but you were there at wrong time of the day. The lighting is very flat. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I have been kicking myself for even entering it. Bu it had to enter something or so I thought. Now I am going to be more careful about the time of day. I guess that means getting up at the crack of dawn from now on, or being there at sunset.</td>', 'Originally posted by DigiFotoBuddy: Looks nice scene, but you were there at wrong time of the day. The lighting is very flat.   I have been kicking myself for even entering it. Bu it had to enter something or so I thought. Now I am going to be more careful about the time of day. I guess that means getting up at the crack of dawn from now on, or being there at sunset.', '2009-04-13 10:18:57.000000', NULL, 0),
