(5435073, 779508, 24454, '<td valign="top">Greg!  WOW!  This is so beautiful!  Your photography talent is just amazing!  Congratulations on such a fine photo to add to your portfolio -- but a personal best and a front page spot in this amazing challenge!  You are the total bomb!  :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Greg!  WOW!  This is so beautiful!  Your photography talent is just amazing!  Congratulations on such a fine photo to add to your portfolio -- but a personal best and a front page spot in this amazing challenge!  You are the total bomb!  :) ', '2009-04-13 15:12:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5435077, 779769, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmygoodness!  I have seen so many photos of these striking, magical falls, and they never get old or cease to look amazing.  But THIS one is the best I''ve ever seen.  Congratulations on absolute perfection.  I feel sure that there is probably not a better postcard of this place out there!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ohmygoodness!  I have seen so many photos of these striking, magical falls, and they never get old or cease to look amazing.  But THIS one is the best I''ve ever seen.  Congratulations on absolute perfection.  I feel sure that there is probably not a better postcard of this place out there! ', '2009-04-13 15:13:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5435085, 779773, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmygoodness!  This is brilliant!  What a fabulous photo!<br/> <br/>And I agree with you 100% on the post-processing thing.  It is perfect exactly like it is.  And I am so glad to see that dpc is doing so much better about rewarding beautifully processed photos instead of going for the ones that are saturated and processed to the point of ugly (in my opinion anyway).<br/> <br/>CONGRATULATIONS!  This is an amazing challenge to score 14th place in!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ohmygoodness!  This is brilliant!  What a fabulous photo! And I agree with you 100% on the post-processing thing.  It is perfect exactly like it is.  And I am so glad to see that dpc is doing so much better about rewarding beautifully processed photos instead of going for the ones that are saturated and processed to the point of ugly (in my opinion anyway). CONGRATULATIONS!  This is an amazing challenge to score 14th place in! ', '2009-04-13 15:18:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5435087, 779732, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is beautiful!  I had no idea Pittsburge was so magical looking.  They really do need to buy this postcard from you.  Congratulations!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow!  This is beautiful!  I had no idea Pittsburge was so magical looking.  They really do need to buy this postcard from you.  Congratulations! ', '2009-04-13 15:19:51.000000', NULL, 0),
