(5438092, 779740, 30982, '<td valign="top">The light was actually quite lovely for this, Susan!  Really has a nice quality to it and gives those gentle crossed shadows on the boardwalk.  Great composition with the boardwalk leading us to that stand of trees, and exceptional clarity and crispness of the scene.  Really does invite one to come visit - such a peaceful, lovely place!</td>', 'The light was actually quite lovely for this, Susan!  Really has a nice quality to it and gives those gentle crossed shadows on the boardwalk.  Great composition with the boardwalk leading us to that stand of trees, and exceptional clarity and crispness of the scene.  Really does invite one to come visit - such a peaceful, lovely place!', '2009-04-15 05:56:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5438099, 779771, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL at your comment!!  This is one that when I saw it in voting I could VERY easily see sitting in a little display at the check-in desk as a postcard you could send to friends and family.  Seriously!  Not sure what you see is wrong with it, other than maybe a tad oversharpened.  I think it''s perfect for a postcard of the place!</td>', 'LOL at your comment!!  This is one that when I saw it in voting I could VERY easily see sitting in a little display at the check-in desk as a postcard you could send to friends and family.  Seriously!  Not sure what you see is wrong with it, other than maybe a tad oversharpened.  I think it''s perfect for a postcard of the place!', '2009-04-15 05:59:16.000000', NULL, 0),
