(5438264, 779607, 30982, '<td valign="top">A really lovely shot, Kelli, and perfect for a postcard!  Has that warm day/gentle breeze/smell of spring feel to it, and wonderful composition.  There''s a similar "view" along a pathway here near where I live, but with weirder trees (I''ll try to get a shot one of these days.)  Nicely done on this!</td>', 'A really lovely shot, Kelli, and perfect for a postcard!  Has that warm day/gentle breeze/smell of spring feel to it, and wonderful composition.  There''s a similar "view" along a pathway here near where I live, but with weirder trees (I''ll try to get a shot one of these days.)  Nicely done on this!', '2009-04-15 09:07:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5438272, 779359, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the way you curved the text to arch over the sun and sort of lead us to the bird.  Also really like the rocks on the shoreline - adds a nice balance to the shot.</td>', 'I like the way you curved the text to arch over the sun and sort of lead us to the bird.  Also really like the rocks on the shoreline - adds a nice balance to the shot.', '2009-04-15 09:13:30.000000', NULL, 0),
