(5442562, 779721, 4226, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>My first thought: Nothing interesting to grab my attention.<br/> <br/>The water in the foreground attracts a lot of attention (which could be the case as your title is reservoir related), but the buildings overcome this, in essence my attention is divided between the two. Also the buildings in the background are not sharp. Water has a lot of distractions as well which could be cloned out for presentation. the color on buildings seems off and brown doesn''t go very well here.<br/> <br/>regards,<br/>Gaurawa<br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! My first thought: Nothing interesting to grab my attention. The water in the foreground attracts a lot of attention (which could be the case as your title is reservoir related), but the buildings overcome this, in essence my attention is divided between the two. Also the buildings in the background are not sharp. Water has a lot of distractions as well which could be cloned out for presentation. the color on buildings seems off and brown doesn''t go very well here. regards,Gaurawa', '2009-04-17 23:02:28.000000', NULL, 0),
